{"type":"message","id":"4b279f85","parentId":"1592450f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:27:38.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The routing logic works. But the HK stock detection isn't working for \"0700.HK\" - it should detect as HK stock but it's showing as US stock routes. The issue is the `.HK` suffix. Let me fix the detection.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"港股检测需要修复一下，`.HK` 后缀没识别到："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6a1256ea7db848a2aab0c946","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"        # 加密货币\n        if any(s.endswith(suffix) for suffix in ['USDT', 'BUSD', 'USDC', 'BTC', 'ETH']):\n            return AssetType.CRYPTO\n        if s in ['BTC', 'ETH', 'BNB', 'SOL', 'XRP', 'DOGE', 'ADA', 'AVAX', 'DOT', 'MATIC']:\n            return AssetType.CRYPTO\n        # 港股 (带 .HK 后缀，或 4-5位数字)\n        if '.HK' in s or s.endswith('HK'):\n            return AssetType.HK_STOCK\n        # A股 (带 .SH/.SZ 后缀)\n        if '.SH' in s or '.SZ' in s:\n            return AssetType.A_STOCK\n        # 纯数字判断\n        clean = s.replace('.', '').replace('-', '')\n        if clean.isdigit():\n            if len(clean) in [4, 5]:\n                return AssetType.HK_STOCK\n            if len(clean) == 6:\n                return AssetType.A_STOCK\n        # 默认美股\n        return AssetType.US_STOCK","old_string":"        # 加密货币\n        if any(s.endswith(suffix) for suffix in ['USDT', 'BUSD', 'USDC', 'BTC', 'ETH']):\n            return AssetType.CRYPTO\n        if s in ['BTC', 'ETH', 'BNB', 'SOL', 'XRP', 'DOGE', 'ADA', 'AVAX', 'DOT', 'MATIC']:\n            return AssetType.CRYPTO\n        # 港股 (4-5位数字)\n        if s.isdigit() and len(s) in [4, 5]:\n            return AssetType.HK_STOCK\n        # A股 (6位数字)\n        if s.isdigit() and len(s) == 6:\n            return AssetType.A_STOCK\n        # 默认美股\n        return AssetType.US_STOCK","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py"}}],"api":"o