{"type":"message","id":"aeb04274","parentId":"c2157cb4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:29:26.936Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's working! Now we can see:\n\n```\n💡 实时报价: $111.03 (-0.32%) [🟢 实时] via finnhub\n```\n\nThe CRCL trader is now using Finnhub for real-time quotes via the SmartDataRouter, and Tiger for K-line data. The integration is complete.\n\nLet me summarize what was done:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"完美！智能路由已成功接入。现在看扫描结果：\n\n```\n💡 实时报价: $111.03 (-0.32%) [🟢 实时] via finnhub\n```\n\n**已完成的工作：**\n\n1. ✅ **`smart_data_router.py`** — 智能数据路由器\n   - Tiger: 港股/A股实时 + 美股历史K线 + 交易\n   - Finnhub: 美股实时行情 (5个Key轮换)\n   - Binance: 加密货币实时+历史\n   - iTick: 跨市场备用\n\n2. ✅ **路由规则：**\n   - 美股实时 → Finnhub → iTick → Polygon\n   - 美股K线 → Tiger (免费) → Polygon → Finnhub\n   - 港股 → Tiger (免费L2)\n   - 加密 → Binance (免费)\n\n3. ✅ **CRCL 交易系统已接入：**\n   - 实时报价走 Finnhub（盘中）/ Tiger（收盘后）\n   - K线数据走 Tiger（免费历史数据）\n   - 交易下单走 Tiger 模拟盘\n   - 自动降级，健康分排序\n\n**文件位置：**\n- 路由器：`chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py`\n- 交易系统：`chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py`（已改造）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1204,"output":483,"cacheRead":61312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62999,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779222560544}}
