{"type":"message","id":"b80da37a","parentId":"37ce7085","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:34:17.372Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8cb86e7799204df8a953da78","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 3.3 扩展层实现要点\n\n**核心原则**: 不修改czsc源码，基于其输出结果进行二次分析\n\n```python\n# czsc_extension.py - czsc扩展层\n\nclass CzscExtension:\n    \"\"\"\n    czsc v0.10.12 扩展层\n    基于czsc核心输出，实现应用层信号识别\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, czsc_result: Dict):\n        self.bi_list = czsc_result.get(\"bi_list\", [])\n        self.zs_list = czsc_result.get(\"zs_list\", [])\n        self.fx_list = czsc_result.get(\"fx_list\", [])\n        self.bars = czsc_result.get(\"bars\", [])\n        self.last_price = czsc_result.get(\"last_price\", 0)\n\n    # ==================== 类二买识别 ====================\n\n    def detect_like_second_buy(self) -> Optional[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        类二买识别\n        定义: 中枢震荡中的第二次买点（不破前低）\n\n        基于czsc输出:\n        - zs_list: 中枢列表（含ZG/ZD/高低点）\n        - bi_list: 笔列表（含方向/高低点）\n        - fx_list: 分型列表\n        \"\"\"\n        if not self.zs_list or len(self.bi_list) < 4:\n            return None\n\n        last_zs = self.zs_list[-1]\n\n        # 获取中枢区间\n        zs_low = getattr(last_zs, \"low\", getattr(last_zs, \"zg\", 0))\n        zs_high = getattr(last_zs, \"high\", getattr(last_zs, \"zd\", 0))\n\n        # 检查是否在中枢下沿附近\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_low) / zs_low > 0.02:\n            return None\n\n        # 检查最近笔是否不创新低\n        recent_bis = self.bi_list[-4:]\n        lows = [getattr(bi, \"low\", 0) for bi in recent_bis if getattr(bi, \"direction\", \"\") == \"向下\"]\n\n        if len(lows) < 2:\n            return None\n\n        if lows[-1] >= lows[-2] * 0.998:  # 不创新低（允许微小误差）\n            # 检查是否有底分型确认\n            if self._has_bottom_fx():\n                return {\n                    \"type\": \"like_second_buy\",\n                    \"confidence\": 0.65,\n                    \"zs_low\": zs_low,\n                    \"zs_high\": zs_high,\n                    \"price\": self.last_price,\n                    \"reason\": \"中枢下沿+不创新低+底分型\"\n                }\n\n        return None\n\n    # ==================== 中枢震荡买卖点 ====================\n\n    def detect_shock_points(self) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        中枢震荡买卖点识别\n        上沿卖 / 下沿买\n        \"\"\"\n        signals = []\n\n        if not self.zs_list:\n            return signals\n\n        last_zs = self.zs_list[-1]\n        zs_low = getattr(last_zs, \"low\", getattr(last_zs, \"zg\", 0))\n        zs_high = getattr(last_zs, \"high\", getattr(last_zs, \"zd\", 0))\n\n        # 靠近上沿 = 卖\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_high) / zs_high < 0.015:\n            signals.append({\n                \"type\": \"shock_sell\",\n                \"direction\": \"SHORT\",\n                \"level\": \"L2\",\n                \"price\": self.last_price,\n                \"target\": zs_low,\n                \"stop\": zs_high * 1.01,\n                \"reason\": \"中枢上沿附近，震荡做空\"\n            })\n\n        # 靠近下沿 = 买\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_low) / zs_low < 0.015:\n            signals.append({\n                \"type\": \"shock_buy\",\n                \"direction\": \"LONG\",\n                \"level\": \"L2\",\n                \"price\": self.last_price,\n                \"target\": zs_high,\n                \"stop\": zs_low * 0.99,\n                \"reason\": \"中枢下沿附近，震荡做多\"\n            })\n\n        return signals\n\n    # ==================== 分型成交量过滤 ====================\n\n    def filter_fx_by_volume(self, min_ratio: float = 1.0) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"\n        分型成交量过滤\n        放量分型优先，低量分型降级\n\n        基于czsc的bars数据（含volume字段）\n        \"\"\"\n        if not self.fx_list or not self.bars:\n            return True  # 无数据，不过滤\n\n        last_fx = self.fx_list[-1]\n        fx_time = getattr(last_fx, \"dt\", None)\n\n        if not fx_time:\n            return True\n\n        # 找到分型对应的K线\n        fx_bars = [b for b in self.bars if getattr(b, \"dt\", \"\") == fx_time]\n        if not fx_bars:\n            return True\n\n        # 计算成交量均值（20根K线）\n        recent_volumes = [getattr(b, \"vol\", 0) for b in self.bars[-20:]]\n        avg_volume = sum(recent_volumes) / len(recent_volumes) if recent_volumes else 1\n\n        fx_volume = getattr(fx_bars[0], \"vol\", 0)\n\n        if avg_volume > 0:\n            ratio = fx_volume / avg_volume\n            return ratio >= min_ratio\n\n        return True\n\n    # ==================== 特殊形态识别 ====================\n\n    def detect_special_forms(self) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        特殊形态识别\n        - 奔走型中枢\n        - 三角形收敛\n        - 旗形整理\n        \"\"\"\n        forms = []\n\n        if len(self.zs_list) < 2:\n            return forms\n\n        # 奔走型中枢: 中枢区间逐步上移/下移\n        recent_zs = self.zs_list[-3:]\n        zs_lows = [getattr(zs, \"low\", 0) for zs in recent_zs]\n        zs_highs = [getattr(zs, \"high\", 0) for zs in recent_zs]\n\n        if len(zs_lows) >= 2:\n            # 检查是否逐步上移\n            if all(zs_lows[i] < zs_lows[i+1] for i in range(len(zs_lows)-1)):\n                forms.append({\n                    \"type\": \"running_zs_up\",\n                    \"description\": \"奔走型中枢（上移）\",\n                    \"implication\": \"多头强势，回调做多\"\n                })\n\n            # 检查是否逐步下移\n            if all(zs_lows[i] > zs_lows[i+1] for i in range(len(zs_lows)-1)):\n                forms.append({\n                    \"type\": \"running_zs_down\",\n                    \"description\": \"奔走型中枢（下移）\",\n                    \"implication\": \"空头强势，反弹做空\"\n                })\n\n        return forms\n\n    # ==================== 多级别共振 ====================\n\n    def check_multi_level_resonance(self, higher_analysis: Dict) -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        多级别共振检查\n        大级别定方向，小级别定入场\n        \"\"\"\n        higher_bi = higher_analysis.get(\"bi_list\", [])\n\n        if not higher_bi:\n            return {\"resonance\": False, \"reason\": \"无大级别数据\"}\n\n        last_higher = higher_bi[-1]\n        higher_direction = getattr(last_higher, \"direction\", \"\")\n\n        # 当前级别\n        if not self.bi_list:\n            return {\"resonance\": False, \"reason\": \"无当前级别数据\"}\n\n        current_direction = getattr(self.bi_list[-1], \"direction\", \"\")\n\n        # 共振判断\n        if higher_direction == \"向上\" and current_direction == \"向下\":\n            # 大级别向上，当前级别回调 = 做多共振\n            return {\n                \"resonance\": True,\n                \"direction\": \"LONG\",\n                \"strength\": 0.8,\n                \"reason\": \"大级别向上+当前回调=二类买共振\"\n            }\n\n        if higher_direction == \"向下\" and current_direction == \"向上\":\n            # 大级别向下，当前级别反弹 = 做空共振\n            return {\n                \"resonance\": True,\n                \"direction\": \"SHORT\",\n                \"strength\": 0.8,\n                \"reason\": \"大级别向下+当前反弹=二类卖共振\"\n            }\n\n        return {\n            \"resonance\": False,\n            \"reason\": f\"大级别{higher_direction}，当前级别{current_direction}，无共振\"\n        }\n\n    # ==================== 辅助方法 ====================\n\n    def _has_bottom_fx(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"检查是否有底分型\"\"\"\n        if not self.fx_list:\n            return False\n        last_fx = self.fx_list[-1]\n        return getattr(last_fx, \"fx_type\", \"\") == \"底分型\"\n```\n\n### 3.4 与现有代码的集成\n\n```python\n# 在ChanlunAgent中使用扩展层\n\nfrom czsc import CZSC\nfrom czsc_extension import CzscExtension\n\nclass SignalEngine:\n    def __init__(self, config):\n        self.config = config\n\n    def analyze_and_generate_signals(self, bars, symbol, timeframe):\n        # 1. czsc核心分析（v0.10.12原生）\n        ka = CZSC(bars)\n\n        czsc_result = {\n            \"bi_list\": getattr(ka, \"bi_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"bis\", []),\n            \"zs_list\": getattr(ka, \"zs_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"zss\", []),\n            \"fx_list\": getattr(ka, \"fx_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"fxs\", []),\n            \"bars\": bars,\n            \"last_price\": bars[-1].close if bars else 0,\n        }\n\n        # 2. 扩展层分析\n        ext = CzscExtension(czsc_result)\n\n        signals = []\n\n        # 2.1 标准背驰（czsc原生）\n        beichi = getattr(ka, \"beichi\", None)\n        if beichi:\n            signals.append({\"type\": \"beichi\", \"detail\": beichi})\n\n        # 2.2 类二买（扩展层）\n        like_second = ext.detect_like_second_buy()\n        if like_second:\n            signals.append(like_second)\n\n        # 2.3 中枢震荡买卖点（扩展层）\n        shock_points = ext.detect_shock_points()\n        signals.extend(shock_points)\n\n        # 2.4 特殊形态（扩展层）\n        forms = ext.detect_special_forms()\n        for form in forms:\n            signals.append({\"type\": \"special_form\", \"detail\": form})\n\n        # 2.5 成交量过滤（扩展层）\n        if not ext.filter_fx_by_volume(min_ratio=self.config.min_volume_ratio):\n            # 低量，降级所有信号\n            for sig in signals:\n                sig[\"level\"] = \"L1\"  # 降级为观察级\n                sig[\"filtered_reason\"] = \"低成交量，信号降级\"\n\n        return signals\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、未来升级策略\n\n### 4.1 监控czsc更新\n\n```python\n# 在Agent中添加版本监控\n\nimport czsc\nimport requests\n\ndef check_czsc_update():\n    \"\"\"检查czsc是否有新版本\"\"\"\n    current = czsc.__version__\n\n    try:\n        response = requests.get(\"https://pypi.org/pypi/czsc/json\", timeout=5)\n        data = response.json()\n        latest = data[\"info\"][\"version\"]\n\n        if latest != current:\n            return {\n                \"has_update\": True,\n                \"current\": current,\n                \"latest\": latest,\n                \"changelog\": data[\"info\"].get(\"summary\", \"\")\n            }\n    except:\n        pass\n\n    return {\"has_update\": False, \"current\": current}\n\n# 在每日日报中添加版本检查\n```\n\n### 4.2 升级决策流程\n\n```\nczsc发布新版本\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. 评估新版本变更日志                   │\n│    - 是否有你需要的功能？               │\n│    - API是否有破坏性变更？              │\n│    - 性能是否有提升？                   │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 2. 沙箱环境测试                         │\n│    - 在Coze沙箱安装新版本               │\n│    - 运行现有分析流程                   │\n│    - 对比结果一致性                     │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 3. 扩展层适配                           │\n│    - 检查扩展层API是否受影响           │\n│    - 调整属性访问方式（bi_list/bis等）  │\n│    - 验证信号生成结果                   │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 4. 模拟盘验证                           │\n│    - 运行1周模拟盘                      │\n│    - 对比信号质量                       │\n│    - 确认无回归                         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 5. 生产环境升级                         │\n│    - 备份当前环境                       │\n│    - 滚动升级（先1个品种）              │\n│    - 监控24小时                         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、结论\n\n| 问题 | 答案 |\n|------|------|\n| **是否应升级czsc？** | **否，保持v0.10.12** |\n| **为什么？** | v0.10.12是2026年3月最新稳定版，Rust核心性能优秀，API稳定 |\n| **如何解决类二买等缺失功能？** | 基于czsc输出（bi_list/zs_list/fx_list）自定义扩展层 |\n| **扩展工作量？** | 4-6天完成类二买+震荡买卖点+分型过滤+特殊形态 |\n| **未来如何跟踪升级？** | 每日日报自动检查PyPI版本，有更新时按流程评估 |\n| **风险？** | 极低。扩展层独立维护，不影响核心稳定性 |\n\n**最终建议**: \n\n> **不要升级czsc。将开发精力集中在「扩展层」和「飞书闭环」上。czsc是你的「引擎」，你的价值在于「整车」。** \n\nv0.10.12的Rust核心提供了足够强大的基础分析能力（笔/线段/中枢/背驰），你需要的类二买、震荡买卖点等属于「应用层策略」，应该在czsc之上构建扩展层，而非修改或替换引擎。\n\n这样设计的好处：\n1. **稳定**: czsc核心不变，不会因为升级引入bug\n2. **可控**: 扩展层代码完全由你掌控，可精确调优\n3. **灵活**: 未来czsc升级时，只需调整扩展层的属性访问方式\n4. **高效**: 4-6天完成扩展，立即解决P0信号质量问题"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"### 3.3 扩展层实现要点\n\n**核心原则**: 不修改czsc源码，基于其输出结果进行二次分析\n\n```python\n# czsc_extension.py - czsc扩展层\n\nclass CzscExtension:\n    \"\"\"\n    czsc v0.10.12 扩展层\n    基于czsc核心输出，实现应用层信号识别\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, czsc_result: Dict):\n        self.bi_list = czsc_result.get(\"bi_list\", [])\n        self.zs_list = czsc_result.get(\"zs_list\", [])\n        self.fx_list = czsc_result.get(\"fx_list\", [])\n        self.bars = czsc_result.get(\"bars\", [])\n        self.last_price = czsc_result.get(\"last_price\", 0)\n\n    # ==================== 类二买识别 ====================\n\n    def detect_like_second_buy(self) -> Optional[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        类二买识别\n        定义: 中枢震荡中的第二次买点（不破前低）\n\n        基于czsc输出:\n        - zs_list: 中枢列表（含ZG/ZD/高低点）\n        - bi_list: 笔列表（含方向/高低点）\n        - fx_list: 分型列表\n        \"\"\"\n        if not self.zs_list or len(self.bi_list) < 4:\n            return None\n\n        last_zs = self.zs_list[-1]\n\n        # 获取中枢区间\n        zs_low = getattr(last_zs, \"low\", getattr(last_zs, \"zg\", 0))\n        zs_high = getattr(last_zs, \"high\", getattr(last_zs, \"zd\", 0))\n\n        # 检查是否在中枢下沿附近\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_low) / zs_low > 0.02:\n            return None\n\n        # 检查最近笔是否不创新低\n        recent_bis = self.bi_list[-4:]\n        lows = [getattr(bi, \"low\", 0) for bi in recent_bis if getattr(bi, \"direction\", \"\") == \"向下\"]\n\n        if len(lows) < 2:\n            return None\n\n        if lows[-1] >= lows[-2] * 0.998:  # 不创新低（允许微小误差）\n            # 检查是否有底分型确认\n            if self._has_bottom_fx():\n                return {\n                    \"type\": \"like_second_buy\",\n                    \"confidence\": 0.65,\n                    \"zs_low\": zs_low,\n                    \"zs_high\": zs_high,\n                    \"price\": self.last_price,\n                    \"reason\": \"中枢下沿+不创新低+底分型\"\n                }\n\n        return None\n\n    # ==================== 中枢震荡买卖点 ====================\n\n    def detect_shock_points(self) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        中枢震荡买卖点识别\n        上沿卖 / 下沿买\n        \"\"\"\n        signals = []\n\n        if not self.zs_list:\n            return signals\n\n        last_zs = self.zs_list[-1]\n        zs_low = getattr(last_zs, \"low\", getattr(last_zs, \"zg\", 0))\n        zs_high = getattr(last_zs, \"high\", getattr(last_zs, \"zd\", 0))\n\n        # 靠近上沿 = 卖\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_high) / zs_high < 0.015:\n            signals.append({\n                \"type\": \"shock_sell\",\n                \"direction\": \"SHORT\",\n                \"level\": \"L2\",\n                \"price\": self.last_price,\n                \"target\": zs_low,\n                \"stop\": zs_high * 1.01,\n                \"reason\": \"中枢上沿附近，震荡做空\"\n            })\n\n        # 靠近下沿 = 买\n        if abs(self.last_price - zs_low) / zs_low < 0.015:\n            signals.append({\n                \"type\": \"shock_buy\",\n                \"direction\": \"LONG\",\n                \"level\": \"L2\",\n                \"price\": self.last_price,\n                \"target\": zs_high,\n                \"stop\": zs_low * 0.99,\n                \"reason\": \"中枢下沿附近，震荡做多\"\n            })\n\n        return signals\n\n    # ==================== 分型成交量过滤 ====================\n\n    def filter_fx_by_volume(self, min_ratio: float = 1.0) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"\n        分型成交量过滤\n        放量分型优先，低量分型降级\n\n        基于czsc的bars数据（含volume字段）\n        \"\"\"\n        if not self.fx_list or not self.bars:\n            return True  # 无数据，不过滤\n\n        last_fx = self.fx_list[-1]\n        fx_time = getattr(last_fx, \"dt\", None)\n\n        if not fx_time:\n            return True\n\n        # 找到分型对应的K线\n        fx_bars = [b for b in self.bars if getattr(b, \"dt\", \"\") == fx_time]\n        if not fx_bars:\n            return True\n\n        # 计算成交量均值（20根K线）\n        recent_volumes = [getattr(b, \"vol\", 0) for b in self.bars[-20:]]\n        avg_volume = sum(recent_volumes) / len(recent_volumes) if recent_volumes else 1\n\n        fx_volume = getattr(fx_bars[0], \"vol\", 0)\n\n        if avg_volume > 0:\n            ratio = fx_volume / avg_volume\n            return ratio >= min_ratio\n\n        return True\n\n    # ==================== 特殊形态识别 ====================\n\n    def detect_special_forms(self) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        特殊形态识别\n        - 奔走型中枢\n        - 三角形收敛\n        - 旗形整理\n        \"\"\"\n        forms = []\n\n        if len(self.zs_list) < 2:\n            return forms\n\n        # 奔走型中枢: 中枢区间逐步上移/下移\n        recent_zs = self.zs_list[-3:]\n        zs_lows = [getattr(zs, \"low\", 0) for zs in recent_zs]\n        zs_highs = [getattr(zs, \"high\", 0) for zs in recent_zs]\n\n        if len(zs_lows) >= 2:\n            # 检查是否逐步上移\n            if all(zs_lows[i] < zs_lows[i+1] for i in range(len(zs_lows)-1)):\n                forms.append({\n                    \"type\": \"running_zs_up\",\n                    \"description\": \"奔走型中枢（上移）\",\n                    \"implication\": \"多头强势，回调做多\"\n                })\n\n            # 检查是否逐步下移\n            if all(zs_lows[i] > zs_lows[i+1] for i in range(len(zs_lows)-1)):\n                forms.append({\n                    \"type\": \"running_zs_down\",\n                    \"description\": \"奔走型中枢（下移）\",\n                    \"implication\": \"空头强势，反弹做空\"\n                })\n\n        return forms\n\n    # ==================== 多级别共振 ====================\n\n    def check_multi_level_resonance(self, higher_analysis: Dict) -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        多级别共振检查\n        大级别定方向，小级别定入场\n        \"\"\"\n        higher_bi = higher_analysis.get(\"bi_list\", [])\n\n        if not higher_bi:\n            return {\"resonance\": False, \"reason\": \"无大级别数据\"}\n\n        last_higher = higher_bi[-1]\n        higher_direction = getattr(last_higher, \"direction\", \"\")\n\n        # 当前级别\n        if not self.bi_list:\n            return {\"resonance\": False, \"reason\": \"无当前级别数据\"}\n\n        current_direction = getattr(self.bi_list[-1], \"direction\", \"\")\n\n        # 共振判断\n        if higher_direction == \"向上\" and current_direction == \"向下\":\n            # 大级别向上，当前级别回调 = 做多共振\n            return {\n                \"resonance\": True,\n                \"direction\": \"LONG\",\n                \"strength\": 0.8,\n                \"reason\": \"大级别向上+当前回调=二类买共振\"\n            }\n\n        if higher_direction == \"向下\" and current_direction == \"向上\":\n            # 大级别向下，当前级别反弹 = 做空共振\n            return {\n                \"resonance\": True,\n                \"direction\": \"SHORT\",\n                \"strength\": 0.8,\n                \"reason\": \"大级别向下+当前反弹=二类卖共振\"\n            }\n\n        return {\n            \"resonance\": False,\n            \"reason\": f\"大级别{higher_direction}，当前级别{current_direction}，无共振\"\n        }\n\n    # ==================== 辅助方法 ====================\n\n    def _has_bottom_fx(self) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"检查是否有底分型\"\"\"\n        if not self.fx_list:\n            return False\n        last_fx = self.fx_list[-1]\n        return getattr(last_fx, \"fx_type\", \"\") == \"底分型\"\n```\n\n### 3.4 与现有代码的集成\n\n```python\n# 在ChanlunAgent中使用扩展层\n\nfrom czsc import CZSC\nfrom czsc_extension import CzscExtension\n\nclass SignalEngine:\n    def __init__(self, config):\n        self.config = config\n\n    def analyze_and_generate_signals(self, bars, symbol, timeframe):\n        # 1. czsc核心分析（v0.10.12原生）\n        ka = CZSC(bars)\n\n        czsc_result = {\n            \"bi_list\": getattr(ka, \"bi_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"bis\", []),\n            \"zs_list\": getattr(ka, \"zs_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"zss\", []),\n            \"fx_list\": getattr(ka, \"fx_list\", []) or getattr(ka, \"fxs\", []),\n            \"bars\": bars,\n            \"last_price\": bars[-1].close if bars else 0,\n        }\n\n        # 2. 扩展层分析\n        ext = CzscExtension(czsc_result)\n\n        signals = []\n\n        # 2.1 标准背驰（czsc原生）\n        beichi = getattr(ka, \"beichi\", None)\n        if beichi:\n            signals.append({\"type\": \"beichi\", \"detail\": beichi})\n\n        # 2.2 类二买（扩展层）\n        like_second = ext.detect_like_second_buy()\n        if like_second:\n            signals.append(like_second)\n\n        # 2.3 中枢震荡买卖点（扩展层）\n        shock_points = ext.detect_shock_points()\n        signals.extend(shock_points)\n\n        # 2.4 特殊形态（扩展层）\n        forms = ext.detect_special_forms()\n        for form in forms:\n            signals.append({\"type\": \"special_form\", \"detail\": form})\n\n        # 2.5 成交量过滤（扩展层）\n        if not ext.filter_fx_by_volume(min_ratio=self.config.min_volume_ratio):\n            # 低量，降级所有信号\n            for sig in signals:\n                sig[\"level\"] = \"L1\"  # 降级为观察级\n                sig[\"filtered_reason\"] = \"低成交量，信号降级\"\n\n        return signals\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、未来升级策略\n\n### 4.1 监控czsc更新\n\n```python\n# 在Agent中添加版本监控\n\nimport czsc\nimport requests\n\ndef check_czsc_update():\n    \"\"\"检查czsc是否有新版本\"\"\"\n    current = czsc.__version__\n\n    try:\n        response = requests.get(\"https://pypi.org/pypi/czsc/json\", timeout=5)\n        data = response.json()\n        latest = data[\"info\"][\"version\"]\n\n        if latest != current:\n            return {\n                \"has_update\": True,\n                \"current\": current,\n                \"latest\": latest,\n                \"changelog\": data[\"info\"].get(\"summary\", \"\")\n            }\n    except:\n        pass\n\n    return {\"has_update\": False, \"current\": current}\n\n# 在每日日报中添加版本检查\n```\n\n### 4.2 升级决策流程\n\n```\nczsc发布新版本\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. 评估新版本变更日志                   │\n│    - 是否有你需要的功能？               │\n│    - API是否有破坏性变更？              │\n│    - 性能是否有提升？                   │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 2. 沙箱环境测试                         │\n│    - 在Coze沙箱安装新版本               │\n│    - 运行现有分析流程                   │\n│    - 对比结果一致性                     │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 3. 扩展层适配                           │\n│    - 检查扩展层API是否受影响           │\n│    - 调整属性访问方式（bi_list/bis等）  │\n│    - 验证信号生成结果                   │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 4. 模拟盘验证                           │\n│    - 运行1周模拟盘                      │\n│    - 对比信号质量                       │\n│    - 确认无回归                         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n    │\n    ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 5. 生产环境升级                         │\n│    - 备份当前环境                       │\n│    - 滚动升级（先1个品种）              │\n│    - 监控24小时                         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 五、结论\n\n| 问题 | 答案 |\n|------|------|\n| **是否应升级czsc？** | **否，保持v0.10.12** |\n| **为什么？** | v0.10.12是2026年3月最新稳定版，Rust核心性能优秀，API稳定 |\n| **如何解决类二买等缺失功能？** | 基于czsc输出（bi_list/zs_list/fx_list）自定义扩展层 |\n| **扩展工作量？** | 4-6天完成类二买+震荡买卖点+分型过滤+特殊形态 |\n| **未来如何跟踪升级？** | 每日日报自动检查PyPI版本，有更新时按流程评估 |\n| **风险？** | 极低。扩展层独立维护，不影响核心稳定性 |\n\n**最终建议**: \n\n> **不要升级czsc。将开发精力集中在「扩展层」和「飞书闭环」上。czsc是你的「引擎」，你的价值在于「整车」。** \n\nv0.10.12的Rust核心提供了足够强大的基础分析能力（笔/线段/中枢/背驰），你需要的类二买、震荡买卖点等属于「应用层策略」，应该在czsc之上构建扩展层，而非修改或替换引擎。\n\n这样设计的好处：\n1. **稳定**: czsc核心不变，不会因为升级引入bug\n2. **可控**: 扩展层代码完全由你掌控，可精确调优\n3. **灵活**: 未来czsc升级时，只需调整扩展层的属性访问方式\n4. **高效**: 4-6天完成扩展，立即解决P0信号质量问题","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779244457369}}
