{"type":"message","id":"7696d892","parentId":"4b3e66ad","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:52:31.692Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking if there are any other impacts. Let me think about what this installation would do:\n\n1. Install kimi-claw plugin - adds a new channel/messaging bridge to Kimi\n2. Install kimiim-cli - adds a CLI tool and some skills\n3. Modify OpenClaw config - adds plugin entries\n4. Restart gateway - brief interruption\n\nPotential impacts:\n- Gateway restart will cause a brief service interruption (a few seconds)\n- The bot-token will be stored in the config\n- It adds new plugin entries to the config\n- The kimiim skills might overlap with existing functionality\n\nBut fundamentally:\n- It doesn't delete anything existing\n\n\n- It doesn't modify existing plugins or conflict with the feishu channel\n- It's purely additive, adding a new channel alongside what's already there\n- The config changes are minimal and the gateway restart is just a brief pause\n\nSo the impact is really just the addition of a new Kimi channel with no effect on existing functionality.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"基本没有负面影响：\n\n**✅ 不影响的：**\n- 飞书渠道不受影响，两个渠道并行\n- 现有插件（feishu/coze/acpx 等）不动\n- 现有代码和项目文件不动\n- czsc/Tiger/Finnhub 等配置不受影响\n\n**⚠️ 唯一的小影响：**\n- Gateway 会重启一次（几秒钟中断）\n- 配置文件里会多一个 `kimi-claw` 插件条目\n- kimiim-cli 装到 `~/.local/bin/`，加3个 skill 目录\n\n**风险极低** — 纯增量安装，不删不改现有东西。不满意随时可以 `openclaw plugins disable kimi-claw` 关掉。\n\n要我执行吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":678,"output":598,"cacheRead":91712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92988,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779245543111}}
