{"type":"message","id":"e338d33f","parentId":"ff2872d8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:13:23.086Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Gateway is running, kimi-claw plugin is loaded. Everything looks good. Let me check if the kimi-claw channel is connected.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Gateway 正常运行，kimi-claw 插件已加载 ✅\n\n系统状态：\n- 飞书渠道 ✅ 正常\n- Kimi 插件 ✅ 已注册\n- 3个 session 活跃中\n\nKimi 渠道应该已经可用了，你可以在 Kimi 那边试试发消息。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":739,"output":139,"cacheRead":96256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97134,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779246798482}}
{"type":"message","id":"6cccdc7c","parentId":"e338d33f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:14:01.463Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe621b154a4c31b8e65061f05d\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fe660cee8ecc39db60f2ece920\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 11:14 GMT+8\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"会不会出现记忆会话断层，预案一下\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe621b154a4c31b8e65061f05d]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"会不会出现记忆会话断层，预案一下\"]\n\n？"}],"timestamp":1779246841460}}
{"type":"message","id":"73d673da","parentId":"6cccdc7c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:14:12.952Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about whether there will be memory/session disconnection issues with the new Kimi channel, and wants a contingency plan. They're replying to a message that asked \"会不会出现记忆会话断层，预案一下\" (Will there be memory/session disconnection, plan for it).\n\nLet me think about this:\n\n1. With two channels (Feishu + Kimi), each channel creates separate sessions\n2. The MEMORY.md and memory files are shared across all sessions\n3. But conversation context (chat history) is per-session\n4. So if VAN switches between Feishu and Kimi, the conversation context won't carry over, but the memory files will be available\n\n\n5. I should verify how the current session setup handles this scenario and whether there are any existing mechanisms to bridge the gap between channels.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。两个渠道并行，记忆确实会有分层风险。让我梳理一下：\n\n**当前架构：**\n- 飞书 = 一个 session（有完整对话历史）\n- Kimi = 另一个 session（独立对话历史）\n- 共享文件：`MEMORY.md` + `memory/*.md` + 项目文件\n\n**会断的东西：**\n- 对话上下文 — 飞书聊的内容，Kimi 那边看不到\n- 短期记忆 — 当前 session 的推理上下文不跨渠道\n\n**不会断的东西：**\n- `MEMORY.md` 长期记忆 — 两边都能读\n- `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` 每日记忆 — 文件级共享\n- 项目文件、代码、配置 — 全部共享\n\n**预案方案：**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02c036ccc1e3499d867a4602","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Cross-Channel Memory Bridge\n\n## 问题\n多渠道（飞书/Kimi）并行时，对话上下文不互通，只有文件级记忆共享。\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 1. 会话摘要自动同步\n每次重要对话结束时，写入 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`，格式包含：\n- 渠道来源（飞书/Kimi）\n- 关键决策\n- 待办事项\n- 上下文片段\n\n### 2. 跨渠道启动协议\n在任一渠道开始新 session 时：\n1. 先读 `MEMORY.md`（长期记忆）\n2. 再读 `memory/今天.md`（今日记录）\n3. 检查是否有来自其他渠道的未完成任务\n\n### 3. HEARTBEAT.md 同步\n心跳任务中加入跨渠道检查：\n- 扫描所有渠道的最近对话\n- 更新共享记忆文件\n\n## 自动执行\n在每个 session 结束时，执行 `scripts/auto-memory.sh`，确保记忆落盘。\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaom