{"type":"message","id":"d78496e7","parentId":"a9bcb312","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:20:43.182Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the script works. Let me now summarize what was done.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**多渠道统一协议已建立。**\n\n**核心机制：**\n\n1. **一个身份** — 不管从飞书还是 Kimi 还是未来任何渠道进来，我都是同一个 Trading Assistant，读同一份记忆\n2. **记忆统一** — `MEMORY.md` + `memory/今天.md` 是所有渠道的共享大脑\n3. **Session 归档** — 每个渠道的对话定期归档到 `memory/sessions/`\n4. **无缝切换** — 新 session 启动时自动加载：长期记忆 → 今日记录 → 最近归档摘要\n\n**文件结构：**\n```\nmemory/\n├── multi-channel-protocol.md    ← 统一协议\n├── cross-channel-protocol.md    ← 跨渠道预案\n├── sessions/                    ← Session 归档目录\n│   └── 2026-05-20-feishu-xxx.md\n│   └── 2026-05-20-kimi-xxx.md\n├── YYYY-MM-DD.md                ← 每日记忆（所有渠道共享）\nMEMORY.md                        ← 长期记忆\n```\n\n**保留策略：**\n- 7天内：全量保留\n- 8-30天：保留摘要\n- 30天+：只留关键决策\n\n**新渠道接入时：** 装插件 → 配 token → 重启 → 自动生效，协议不用改。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":145,"output":349,"cacheRead":101248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101742,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779247233727}}
