{"type":"message","id":"8bb2113e","parentId":"52a7ffb8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:22:43.674Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to review the conversation. This message came from Kimi channel. Let me check what context I have from this session and provide a summary of what's been discussed.\n\nLooking at the conversation history in this session, I can see:\n1. CRCL simulation report request\n2. Tiger API data source discussion\n3. Smart Data Router creation\n4. Doubao thread content (ChanlunAgent capability assessment)\n5. czsc version upgrade analysis\n6. Kimi Claw installation\n7. Multi-channel memory protocol setup\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive review.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，船长。以下是本次会话的完整回顾：\n\n---\n\n**本次会话总结（2026-05-20）**\n\n**一、CRCL 缠论模拟交易**\n- 生成了实时报告：CRCL $111.03，日线中性，5分钟下跌，无交易信号\n- 发现数据源问题：Tiger 美股只有历史K线收盘价，不是实时行情\n\n**二、Smart Data Router 智能路由器**\n- 创建 `data/smart_data_router.py`，按品种/任务自动选最优数据源\n- 美股实时 → Finnhub → iTick → Polygon\n- 美股K线 → Tiger（免费）\n- 港股 → Tiger（免费L2）\n- 加密 → Binance（免费）\n- 已接入 CRCL 交易系统，实时报价走 Finnhub\n\n**三、豆包对话（缠论Agent能力摸底）**\n- 逐条回答了23项能力评估\n- 识别出三大核心短板：信号质量粗糙、自进化闭环缺失、风控不完整\n- 优先级：信号质量 > 风控 > 自进化\n\n**四、czsc 版本升级决策**\n- 结论：保持 v0.10.12，不升级核心库\n- 方案：构建 CzscExtension 扩展层\n- 四个模块：类二买识别、中枢震荡买卖点、分型成交量过滤、特殊形态识别\n- 工作量估算：4-6天\n\n**五、Kimi 渠道接入**\n- 安装 kimi-claw 插件 + kimiim-cli + 3个 skill\n- 飞书 + Kimi 双渠道并行运行\n\n**六、多渠道统一协议**\n- 核心原则：一个身份、记忆统一、Session 归档、无缝切换\n- 创建 `memory/multi-channel-protocol.md`\n- 创建 `scripts/session-archive.sh` 归档脚本\n- 保留策略：7天全量 → 30天摘要 → 30天+关键决策\n\n---\n\n**待办事项：**\n1. CzscExtension 扩展层实现（类二买/震荡买卖点/分型过滤/特殊形态）\n2. 清理旧版残留配置 `openclaw-kimi-bridge-connector`\n3. Session 归档机制自动化（heartbeat 中集成）\n\n**下一步建议：** 优先实现 CzscExtension 扩展层，解决信号质量问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":98772,"output":791,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99563,"cost":{"input":0,"