nt: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (exec): #!/bin/bash\n\n# 将所有参数传递给第二个脚本\necho \"Starting parallel installation...\"\n\nbash <(curl -s 'https://kimi-img.moonshot.cn/pub/claw/tmp/lihuaru/skills/kimiim/install.sh') &\nPID1=$!\n\nbash <(curl -s 'https://cdn.kimi.com/kimi-claw/install.sh') \"$@\" &\nPID2=$!\n\n# 等待两个进程都完成\nwait $PID1\nEXIT1=$?\n\nwait $PID2\nEXIT2=$?\n\n# 检查执行结果\nif [[ $EXIT1 -eq 0 && $EXIT2 -eq 0 ]]; then\n    echo \"Both installations completed successfully!\"\n    exit 0\nelse\n    echo \"Installation failed!\"\n    [[ $EXIT1 -ne 0 ]] && echo \"  - First script exited with code $EXIT1\"\n    [[ $EXIT2 -ne 0 ]] && echo \"  - Second script exited with code...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall x2]\n- Tool result (exec): #!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nBASE_URL=\"${BASE_URL:-https://cdn.kimi.com/kimi-claw}\"\nTGZ_URL=\"${TGZ_URL:-$BASE_URL/kimi-claw-latest.tgz}\"\nSEARCH_TGZ_URL_FALLBACK=\"${SEARCH_TGZ_URL_FALLBACK:-$BASE_URL/openclaw-kimi-search-0.1.9.tgz}\"\nSEARCH_TGZ_URL_EXPLICIT=\"0\"\nif [ -n \"${SEARCH_TGZ_URL+x}\" ]; then\n  SEARCH_TGZ_URL_EXPLICIT=\"1\"\nfi\nSEARCH_TGZ_URL=\"${SEARCH_TGZ_URL:-$SEARCH_TGZ_URL_FALLBACK}\"\nCRON_MIGRATION_SCRIPT_URL=\"${CRON_MIGRATION_SCRIPT_URL:-$BASE_URL/migrate_kimi_claw_cron_to_main_via_openclaw_cli.sh}\"\nCRON_MIGRATION_MIN_VERSION=\"${CRON_MIGRATION_MIN_VERSION:-0.19.0}\"\nFORCE_CRON_M...\n- Tool result (exec): #!/usr/bin/env bash\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\n# kimiim-cli 安装脚本 - 支持多平台多架构\n\n# 版本号\nVERSION=\"latest\"\n\n# 基础下载 URL\nBASE_URL=\"https://kimi-img.moonshot.cn/pub/claw/tmp/lihuaru/skills/kimiim\"\n\n# 安装目录\nINSTALL_DIR=\"$HOME/.local/bin\"\n\n# Openclaw 工作目录（用于存放 SKILL.md）\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace/skills/kimiim\"\n\n# 颜色输出\nRED='\\033[0;31m'\nGREEN='\\033[0;32m'\nYELLOW='\\033[1;33m'\nBLUE='\\033[0;34m'\nNC='\\033[0m' # No Color\n\n# 日志函数\nlog_info() {\n  echo -e \"${BLUE}[INFO]${NC} $1\"\n}\n\nlog_success() {\n  echo -e \"${GREEN}[SUCCESS]${NC} $1\"\n}\n\nlog_warn() {\n  echo -e \"${YELLOW}[WARN]${NC} $1\"\n}\n\nlog_error() {\n  echo ...\n- Assistant: 脚本内容审查完毕，是合法的 Kimi Claw 安装器。做的事情：\n\n1. **kimi-claw plugin** — Kimi 消息桥接插件，通过 WebSocket 连接 `wss://www.kimi.com/api-claw/bots/agent-ws`，用 bot-token 认证\n2. **kimiim-cli** — Kimi IM 命令行工具 + 3个 skill（kimiim/worker-safety/time-awareness）\n3. 修改 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 注册插件\n4. 重启 gateway\n\n**⚠️ 这会修改你的 OpenClaw 配置并重启 gateway。** 要继续执行吗？\n[non-text content: thinking]\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fe650a94cf4c2402c9c1ff1597\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-20 10:52 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fe650a94cf4c2402c9c1ff1597]\nVAN: 其它没有影响吧？\n- Assistant: 基本没有负面影响：\n\n**✅ 不影响的：**\n- 飞书渠道不受影响，两个渠道并行\n- 现有插件（feishu/coze/acpx 等）不动\n- 现有代码和项目文件不动\n- czsc/Tiger/Finnhub 等配置不受影响\n\n**⚠️ 唯一的小影响：**\n- Gateway 会重启一次（几秒钟中断）\n- 配置文件里会多一个 `kimi-claw` 插件条目\n- kimiim-cli 装到 `~/.local/bin/`，加3个 skill 目录\n\n**风险极低** — 纯增量安装，不删不改现有东西。不满意随时可以 `openclaw plugins disable kimi-claw` 关掉。\n\n要我执行吗？\n[non-text content: thinking]\n\n<read-files>\n/workspace/projects/extensions/coze-openclaw-plugin/skills/coze-asr/SKILL.md\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"99ceeb0f","tokensBefore":120015,"details":{"readFiles":["/workspace/projects/extensions/coze-openclaw-plugin/skills/coze-asr/SKILL.md"],"modifiedFiles":["/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py"]},"fromHook":true}
