{"type":"message","id":"b2a2e309","parentId":"97894c56","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:50:48.838Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The czsc analysis worked, but we have a JSON serialization issue with the ZhongShu dataclass. I need to make it JSON serializable by adding a to_dict method or converting it before saving.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"分析成功但序列化失败。修复 ZhongShu 的 JSON 序列化："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6d9cac317ab849a9a8b31ce9","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"@dataclass\nclass ZhongShu:\n    \"\"\"中枢\"\"\"\n    high: float          # 中枢上沿 (ZG)\n    low: float           # 中枢下沿 (ZD)\n    sdt: str             # 开始时间\n    edt: str             # 结束时间\n    bi_count: int = 0    # 包含笔数量\n    direction: str = \"\"  # 方向 (up/down/neutral)\n    level: str = \"L1\"    # 级别\n\n    @property\n    def mid(self) -> float:\n        return (self.high + self.low) / 2\n\n    @property\n    def range(self) -> float:\n        return self.high - self.low\n\n    @property\n    def range_pct(self) -> float:\n        return self.range / self.mid * 100 if self.mid else 0\n\n    def to_dict(self) -> Dict:\n        return {\n            'high': self.high,\n            'low': self.low,\n            'sdt': self.sdt,\n            'edt': self.edt,\n            'bi_count': self.bi_count,\n            'direction': self.direction,\n            'level': self.level,\n            'mid': self.mid,\n            'range': self.range,\n        }","old_string":"@dataclass\nclass ZhongShu:\n    \"\"\"中枢\"\"\"\n    high: float          # 中枢上沿 (ZG)\n    low: float           # 中枢下沿 (ZD)\n    sdt: str             # 开始时间\n    edt: str             # 结束时间\n    bi_count: int = 0    # 包含笔数量\n    direction: str = \"\"  # 方向 (up/down/neutral)\n    level: str = \"L1\"    # 级别\n\n    @property\n    def mid(self) -> float:\n        return (self.high + self.low) / 2\n\n    @property\n    def range(self) -> float:\n        return self.hi