{"type":"message","id":"ecd93674","parentId":"5afaeb09","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:52:41.453Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e8d12911354c4924925696ad","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 多级别共振分析 ===\n品种: CRCL\n多级别联立分析:\n\n【daily】\n  笔数: 8 | 中枢: 2\n\n【30min】\n  笔数: 16 | 中枢: 2\n\n【5min】\n  笔数: 10 | 中枢: 2\n\n无有效信号\n\n📭 无有效信号"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2200,"aggregated":"=== 多级别共振分析 ===\n品种: CRCL\n多级别联立分析:\n\n【daily】\n  笔数: 8 | 中枢: 2\n\n【30min】\n  笔数: 16 | 中枢: 2\n\n【5min】\n  笔数: 10 | 中枢: 2\n\n无有效信号\n\n📭 无有效信号","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779285161450}}
