{"type":"message","id":"28a349f1","parentId":"c49cb14e","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:56:09.146Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e97532e150c7497f9c8332c6","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"风控引擎: ✅\n品种: CRCL\n多级别联立分析:\n\n【daily】\n  笔数: 8 | 中枢: 2\n\n【30min】\n  笔数: 16 | 中枢: 2\n\n【5min】\n  笔数: 9 | 中枢: 2\n\n无有效信号\n\n📭 无交易信号"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2087,"aggregated":"风控引擎: ✅\n品种: CRCL\n多级别联立分析:\n\n【daily】\n  笔数: 8 | 中枢: 2\n\n【30min】\n  笔数: 16 | 中枢: 2\n\n【5min】\n  笔数: 9 | 中枢: 2\n\n无有效信号\n\n📭 无交易信号","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779285369142}}
{"type":"message","id":"28d3f08a","parentId":"28a349f1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:56:24.434Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both multi-level resonance and risk engine are working. Now let me move on to the next items. Let me check the remaining items:\n\n1. ✅ 多级别共振接入信号流\n2. ✅ 风控引擎实际生效（时间止损/中枢止损/熔断）\n3. 飞书全闭环交互\n\nLet me now work on #3 - Feishu full loop interaction. But first, let me also verify the reflection engine status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 风控引擎已接入信号流**（技术止损/时间止损/资金止损/连续亏损熔断）\n\n**第3项：反思引擎接入**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7116596ef1364fdd8204ed49","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":60,"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":109306,"output":271,"cacheRead":4096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113673,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779285369148}}
{"type":"message","id":"fbe337ed","parentId":"28d3f08a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:56:24.441Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7116596ef1364fdd8204ed49","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n自动反思引擎\nChanlunAgent MVP - Day 22+ 自进化闭环\n\n功能：\n1. 交易后自动反思（平仓后5分钟内）\n2. 连续亏损深度反思（连亏3笔触发）\n3. 周度反思汇总（每周日）\n4. 参数优化建议\n\nAuthor: Trading Assistant\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport logging\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom typing import Dict, List, Optional\nfrom store import TokenStore\n\nlogger = logging.getLogger(\"ReflectionEngine\")\n\n\nclass ReflectionEngine:\n    \"\"\"自动反思引擎\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, store: TokenStore):\n        self.store = store\n\n    def generate_post_trade_reflection(self, trade: Dict) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        交易后自动反思\n        平仓后自动生成结构化反思\n        \"\"\"\n        symbol = trade.get('symbol', 'N/A')\n        direction = trade.get('direction', 'N/A')\n        entry_price = trade.get('entry_price', 0)\n        exit_price = trade.get('exit_price', 0)\n        pnl = trade.get('pnl', 0) or 0\n        pnl_pct = trade.get('pnl_pct', 0) or 0\n        signal_type = trade.get('signal_type', 'N/A')\n\n        # 结构化反思\n        reflection = f\"\"\"## {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d')} {symbol} {direction} {'✅盈利' if pnl > 0 else '❌亏损'} {pnl_pct:+.2f}%\n\n### 结构分析\n- 入场价: ${entry_price:.2f} | 出场价: ${exit_price:.2f}\n- 信号类型: {signal_type}\n- 盈亏: ${pnl:.2f} ({pnl_pct:+.2f}%)\n\n### 决策回顾\n- 入场理由: {signal_type} 信号触发\n- 出场理由: {'止盈' if pnl > 0 else '止损/信号反转'}\n\n### 归因分析\n- {'盈利主要来自缠论结构判断准确' if pnl > 0 else '亏损原因需要进一步分析市场环境和信号质量'}\n\n### 改进措施\n- {'保持当前策略参数' if pnl > 0 else '检查止损设置是否合理，信号过滤是否需要加强'}\n\n[227 more lines in file. Use offset=61 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779285384439}}
{"type":"message","id":"12307ee2","parentId":"fbe337ed","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:56:54.860Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The reflection engine looks good. It has structured reflection templates. Now let me check what's left to do for Feishu full loop interaction. But first, let me verify all three engines (czsc extension, risk engine, reflection engine) are integrated properly.\n\nActually, let me check if reflection engine is integrated into the CRCL trader.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1c5ff24101a44a20a6e64a81","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"reflection\\|Reflection\" /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":60462,"output":190,"cacheRead":53248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113900,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779285384444}}
