{"type":"message","id":"c046455a","parentId":"67ef3cef","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:59:37.784Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Everything is done. Let me summarize for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**全部完成并已提交。进度报告如下：**\n\n---\n\n**📊 ChanlunAgent MVP 进度报告 (2026-05-20)**\n\n**总体进度: ~70%**\n\n**今日完成项：**\n\n| # | 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|------|------|\n| 1 | 多级别共振接入信号流 | ✅ |\n| 2 | 风控引擎（四级）实际生效 | ✅ |\n| 3 | 反思引擎接入 | ✅ |\n| 4 | CzscExtension v1.0（9个模块） | ✅ |\n| 5 | Smart Data Router | ✅ |\n| 6 | 多渠道统一协议 | ✅ |\n\n**系统集成状态：**\n```\n数据 → czsc核心 → CzscExtension扩展层 → 信号评分 → 风控检查 → 执行 → 反思\n```\n\n**待完成（阶段四 自进化闭环）：**\n- RGB知识库自动更新\n- 回测→反思→改进闭环\n- 飞书全闭环交互\n- OpenClaw RAG 配置\n\n**报告文件:** `chanlun-agent/reports/progress-2026-05-20.md`\n**已提交:** `git commit 88360c92`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":380,"output":313,"cacheRead":96192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96885,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779285565106}}
