{"type":"message","id":"c63a215a","parentId":"319701b9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:06:50.386Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to continue with the remaining items in order. The next items are from阶段四（自进化闭环）：\n\n1. RGB知识库自动更新 (P1, 2天)\n2. 回测→反思→改进闭环 (P1, 3天)\n1. RGB知识库自动更新 — priority P1, 2 days\n2. 回测→反思→改进闭环 — priority P1, 3 days\n3. 飞书全闭环交互 — priority P2, 2 days\n4. P1 items first: RGB knowledge base auto-update and backtesting loop\n5. Then P2: Feishu full loop interaction and RAG configuration\n\nLet me start with the RGB knowledge base auto-update mechanism.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，继续推进阶段四。下一项：**RGB 知识库自动更新**。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01ba167a26814bf78be5f732","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/bi_rules.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":8825,"output":373,"cacheRead":113344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122542,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779285993075}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f7ea3a1","parentId":"c63a215a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:06:50.393Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01ba167a26814bf78be5f732","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 笔划分精确规则 - czsc v0.10.12 API 映射\n\n## 基本定义\n\n**笔 (Bi)**：连接两个相邻分型的线段，是缠论最基本的分析单位。\n\n## czsc v0.10.12 API\n\n| 操作 | API | 返回类型 |\n|------|-----|----------|\n| 获取笔列表 | `ka.bi_list` | `List[Bi]` |\n| 获取分型列表 | `ka.fx_list` | `List[Fx]` |\n| 获取最后一笔 | `ka.bi_list[-1]` | `Bi` |\n\n## 笔的划分规则\n\n### 1. 顶分型 → 底分型 = 向下笔\n- 顶分型中间K线高点 > 两侧K线高点\n- 底分型中间K线低点 < 两侧K线低点\n- 顶分型后必须有底分型\n\n### 2. 底分型 → 顶分型 = 向上笔\n- 底分型中间K线低点 < 两侧K线低点\n- 顶分型中间K线高点 > 两侧K线高点\n- 底分型后必须有顶分型\n\n### 3. K线包含处理\n- 上涨中：取高高（两根K线中取较高的高点和较高的低点）\n- 下跌中：取低低（两根K线中取较低的高点和较低的低点）\n\n## 分型过滤规则（李小军风格）\n\n### 放量分型优先\n- 分型中间K线成交量 > 前一根K线成交量 × 1.5\n- 放量分型的可靠性更高\n\n### 验证分型确认\n- 底分型确认：分型后一根K线收盘价 > 底分型中间K线最高价\n- 顶分型确认：分型后一根K线收盘价 < 顶分型中间K线最低价\n\n### 低量过滤\n- 成交量 < 20日均量的50% → 分型降级处理\n- 低量分型不作为主要交易信号\n\n## Bi 对象属性\n\n```python\nclass Bi:\n    index: int          # 笔序号\n    fx: Fx              # 起始分型\n    bi_direction: str   # 笔方向: \"up\" / \"down\"\n    high: float         # 笔最高点\n    low: float          # 笔最低点\n    start_dt: datetime  # 开始时间\n    end_dt: datetime    # 结束时间\n    bars: int           # 包含K线数量\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```python\nfrom czsc import CZSC\n\nka = CZSC(bars)\nfor bi in ka.bi_list:\n    print(f\"笔{bi.index}: {bi.bi_direction} [{bi.low:.2f}, {bi.high:.2f}]\")\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286010391}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed9b2994","parentId":"3f7ea3a1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:07:07.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to continue with the next priority item from the roadmap. Let me check what's next after the items already completed.\n\nLooking at the roadmap:\n- ✅ 多级别共振接入信号流\n- ✅ 风控引擎（四级）实际生效\n- ✅ 反思引擎接入\n- ✅ CzscExtension v1.0\n- ✅ Smart Data Router\n- ✅ 多渠道统一协议\n\nNext items (Stage 4: 自进化闭环):\n1. RGB知识库自动更新 (P1, 2天)\n2. 回测→反思→改进闭环 (P1, 3天)\n3. 飞书全闭环交互 (P2, 2天)\n4. OpenClaw RAG 配置 (P2, 1天)\n5. 参数自动优化 (P3, 3天)\n\nLet me read the existing knowledge base content and then implement the auto-update mechanism.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_57a715987a884a67a8f473df","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/zs_rules.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":69461,"output":440,"cacheRead":53248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123149,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286010395}}
{"type":"message","id":"4627777d","parentId":"ed9b2994","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:07:07.658Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_57a715987a884a67a8f473df","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 中枢识别精确规则 - czsc v0.10.12 API 映射\n\n## 基本定义\n\n**中枢 (ZS)**：至少三笔重叠区间形成的盘整区域。\n\n## czsc v0.10.12 API\n\n| 操作 | API | 返回类型 |\n|------|-----|----------|\n| 中枢列表 | `ka.zs_list` | `List[ZS]` |\n| 最后一个中枢 | `ka.zs_list[-1]` | `ZS` |\n\n## 中枢构成规则\n\n### 连续三笔重叠\n- 取连续三笔的重叠区间\n- ZG = min(三笔的高点) — 中枢上沿\n- ZD = max(三笔的低点) — 中枢下沿\n- GG = max(三笔的高点) — 中枢最高点\n- DD = min(三笔的低点) — 中枢最低点\n\n### 中枢成立条件\n- ZG > ZD（上沿必须高于下沿）\n- 至少包含三笔\n\n## 中枢扩展\n\n### 中枢扩展条件\n- 后续笔的高低点与中枢有重叠\n- 扩展不改变 ZG/ZD，只扩展中枢区间\n\n### 中枢升级\n- 中枢扩展超过9笔 → 可能形成更大级别中枢\n\n## ZS 对象属性\n\n```python\nclass ZS:\n    index: int          # 中枢序号\n    zg: float           # 中枢上沿\n    zd: float           # 中枢下沿\n    gg: float           # 最高点\n    dd: float           # 最低点\n    direction: str      # 中枢方向\n    bis: List[Bi]       # 包含的笔列表\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```python\nfrom czsc import CZSC\n\nka = CZSC(bars)\nfor zs in ka.zs_list:\n    print(f\"中枢{zs.index}: [{zs.zd:.2f}, {zs.zg:.2f}]\")\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286027656}}
{"type":"message","id":"059ca490","parentId":"4627777d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:07:15.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me read the guides and practices too.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2d03c1f5dd4e4022b59be2d5","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":9336,"output":58,"cacheRead":113664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123058,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286027660}}
{"type":"message","id":"c1c1a8ab","parentId":"059ca490","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:07:15.735Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2d03c1f5dd4e4022b59be2d5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 四级信号执行 SOP\n\n## 信号分级定义\n\n| 级别 | 名称 | 条件 | 仓位建议 | 动作 |\n|------|------|------|----------|------|\n| L1 | 预警 | 单一级别背驰 | 空仓观望 | 记录信号，等待确认 |\n| L2 | 准备 | 两级共振背驰 | 10-20% 仓位 | 准备下单，等分型确认 |\n| L3 | 行动 | 三级共振 + 分型确认 | 30-50% 仓位 | 执行入场 |\n| L4 | 重仓 | 三级共振 + 放量突破 | 50-80% 仓位 | 加仓/满仓 |\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### L1 预警\n1. 检测到单一级别（如5分钟）背驰\n2. 记录到信号日志\n3. 等待更高级别确认\n\n### L2 准备\n1. 两个级别同时出现背驰信号\n2. 准备下单参数（价格、数量、止损位）\n3. 等待分型确认\n\n### L3 行动\n1. 三个级别（5分钟 + 30分钟 + 日线）共振\n2. 分型已确认\n3. 执行下单\n4. 设置止损（技术止损 + 时间止损）\n\n### L4 重仓\n1. 三级共振 + 成交量放大\n2. 加仓至目标仓位\n3. 移动止损保护利润\n\n## 止损设置\n\n| 止损类型 | 触发条件 | 动作 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| 技术止损 | 价格跌回中枢内 | 全部平仓 |\n| 时间止损 | N根K线未达预期 | 减仓50% |\n| 资金止损 | 单笔亏损 > 3% | 全部平仓 |\n| 日止损 | 当日累计亏损 > 8% | 停止交易 |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286035733}}
{"type":"message","id":"c40d0616","parentId":"c1c1a8ab","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:07:33.181Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the knowledge base structure. Let me implement the RGB knowledge base auto-update mechanism. The idea is that after each trade (especially after reflection), the system should automatically update the knowledge base with new rules/guides/practices learned from the trade.\n\nLet me create a knowledge updater module.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_558c621b1a5a4134ad96016c","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nRGB Knowledge Updater - RGB 知识库自动更新引擎\n\n功能：\n1. 交易反思 → 自动提取规则/指南/最佳实践\n2. 连续模式识别 → 生成新规则\n3. 失败案例 → 生成风险提示\n4. 成功案例 → 强化有效模式\n\nAuthor: Trading Assistant\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport logging\nimport os\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import Dict, List, Optional\n\nlogger = logging.getLogger(\"RGBUpdater\")\n\nKNOWLEDGE_DIR = Path(__file__).parent.parent / \"knowledge\"\n\n\nclass RGBUpdater:\n    \"\"\"RGB 知识库自动更新\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, knowledge_dir: Path = KNOWLEDGE_DIR):\n        self.knowledge_dir = knowledge_dir\n        self.r_dir = knowledge_dir / \"R-rules\"\n        self.g_dir = knowledge_dir / \"G-guides\"\n        self.b_dir = knowledge_dir / \"B-practices\"\n        self._ensure_dirs()\n\n    def _ensure_dirs(self):\n        \"\"\"确保目录存在\"\"\"\n        for d in [self.r_dir, self.g_dir, self.b_dir]:\n            d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n    # ==================== R-规则库更新 ====================\n\n    def add_signal_rule(self, signal_type: str, conditions: List[str],\n                        reliability: float, source: str = \"\"):\n        \"\"\"\n        添加信号规则\n\n        Args:\n            signal_type: 信号类型（如 bottom_divergence）\n            conditions: 触发条件列表\n            reliability: 可靠性评分 (0-1)\n            source: 来源（交易反思/回测结果）\n        \"\"\"\n        rule_file = self.r_dir / f\"{signal_type}_rules.md\"\n\n        rule_content = f\"\\n## {signal_type} 规则更新 ({datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d')})\\n\"\n        rule_content += f\"- **可靠性:** {reliability:.0%}\\n\"\n        rule_content += f\"- **来源:** {source}\\n\"\n        rule_content += f\"- **条件:**\\n\"\n        for cond in conditions:\n            rule_content += f\"  - {cond}\\parameter name=\"content\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":575,"output":653,"cacheRead":122944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":124172,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286035737}}
