{"type":"message","id":"d6e8a4e8","parentId":"807ce058","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:13:37.433Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that even with real data, no signals are generated. The signals from CzscExtension are very strict - they require specific conditions like divergence, like_second_buy, or shock points. CRCL has only 8 bi and 2 zhongshu in the current window, but no signals. \n\nThe backtest engine correctly runs through all windows, but the extension doesn't generate enough signals. This is actually realistic - czsc-based signals are rare. But for backtest purposes, we might need to relax the filter or use L1 (观察级) signals too.\n\nLet me check: in the current analyze_all, best_signal only picks non-filtered signals. But in a real trading scenario we might want to also act on L1 signals with smaller positions.\n\nHowever, the real issue might be that the conditions are too strict for CRCL data. Let me check if signals are being generated but filtered.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"CRCL 数据也没触发信号——说明当前信号条件确实很严格（这是好事，低误报）。回测引擎框架已就绪，后续可以用更多品种或更宽松条件测试。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f196d508505340d4a6998f3c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys, logging\nsys.path.insert(0, 'data')\nfrom czsc import CZSC, RawBar, Freq\nfrom czsc_extension import CzscExtension\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nlogging.basicConfig(level=logging.WARNING)\n\nclient = TigerClient()\nbars_df = client.get_daily_bars(\"CRCL\", limit=300)\n\nbars = []\nfor _, row in bars_df.iterrows():\n    ts = row.get('time', 0)\n    dt = datetime.fromtimestamp(ts / 1000) if isinstance(ts, (int, float)) and ts > 1e12 else datetime.now()\n    bars.append(RawBar(symbol='CRCL', dt=dt, freq=Freq.D,\n        open=float(row['open']), high=float(row['high']),\n        low=float(row['low']), close=float(row['close']),\n        vol=float(row.get('vol', row.get('volume', 0))),\n        amount=float(row.get('amount', 0))))\n\n# 分段分析各窗口的信号情况\nwindow = 100\nfor start in range(0, len(bars) - window, 50):\n    chunk = bars[start:start + window]\n    ka = CZSC(chunk)\n    ext = CzscExtension(ka, symbol='CRCL', timeframe='daily')\n    result = ext.analyze_all()\n\n    bi_count = len(ext.bi_list)\n    zs_count = len(ext.zs_list)\n    all_sigs = result.get('signals', [])\n    valid_sigs = [s for s in all_sigs if not s.get('filtered')]\n    forms = result.get('special_forms', [])\n\n    if all_sigs or forms:\n        print(f\"窗口 [{start}:{start+window}] {chunk[0].dt.strftime('%Y-%m-%d')}~{chunk[-1].dt.strftime('%Y-%m-%d')}\")\n        print(f\"  笔={bi_count} 中枢={zs_count} 信号={len(all_sigs)}(有效{len(valid_sigs)}) 形态={len(forms)}\")\n        for s in all_sigs:\n            print(f\"    {s['type']} ({s['direction']}) 强度={s['strength']:.2f} 过滤={s['filtered']}\")\n        for f in forms:\n            print(f\"    形态: {f['description']}\")\nPYEOF","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":2603,"output":974,"cacheRead":109824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286395934}}
