{"type":"message","id":"3fbfe9de","parentId":"9540742c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:26.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Typo in the path. Let me try again.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cda4016782df428eace9e2f8","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":80,"offset":149,"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":148,"output":77,"cacheRead":117184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117409,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286511027}}
{"type":"message","id":"bcb0a52f","parentId":"3fbfe9de","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:26.353Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_cda4016782df428eace9e2f8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    def handle_command(self, command: str, args: str = \"\", message_id: str = \"\") -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        处理飞书指令\n\n        Args:\n            command: 指令名称（持仓/分析/信号/帮助等）\n            args: 指令参数\n            message_id: 原始消息ID（用于回复）\n\n        Returns:\n            响应文本\n        \"\"\"\n        handler_map = {\n            \"持仓\": self._cmd_positions,\n            \"分析\": self._cmd_analyze,\n            \"信号\": self._cmd_signals,\n            \"平仓\": self._cmd_close,\n            \"反思\": self._cmd_reflect,\n            \"日报\": self._cmd_daily_report,\n            \"状态\": self._cmd_status,\n            \"帮助\": self._cmd_help,\n        }\n\n        handler = handler_map.get(command)\n        if handler:\n            try:\n                return handler(args)\n            except Exception as e:\n                logger.error(f\"Command '{command}' failed: {e}\")\n                return f\"❌ 执行失败: {str(e)}\"\n        else:\n            return f\"❓ 未知指令: {command}\\n\\n\" + self._cmd_help(\"\")\n\n    # ============ 指令实现 ============\n\n    def _cmd_positions(self, args: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"查询持仓\"\"\"\n        trades = self.store.get_open_trades()\n        if not trades:\n            return \"💼 当前空仓\"\n\n        lines = [\"💼 当前持仓:\\n\"]\n        for t in trades:\n            emoji = \"🟢\" if t['direction'] == 'long' else \"🔴\"\n            lines.append(\n                f\"{emoji} {t['symbol']} | {t['direction']} | \"\n                f\"入场: ${t['entry_price']:.2f} | 数量: {t['quantity']}\"\n            )\n        return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\n    def _cmd_analyze(self, args: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"缠论分析（含扩展：类二买/中枢震荡/背驰/风控）\"\"\"\n        symbol = args.strip() or self.config.symbol.symbol\n        market = self.config.symbol.market\n\n        structures = self.perception.analyze_symbol(symbol, market, [\"日线\", \"30分钟\", \"5分钟\"])\n\n        lines = [f\"📊 {symbol} 缠论分析:\\n\"]\n        for freq, structure in structures.items():\n            trend_emoji = \"📈\" if structure.trend == \"up\" else \"📉\" if structure.trend == \"down\" else \"➡️\"\n            lines.append(f\"【{freq}】{trend_emoji} {structure.trend}\")\n            lines.append(f\"  笔: {structure.bi_count} | 中枢: {structure.zs_count}\")\n            if structure.last_zs_range:\n                lines.append(f\"  中枢区间: [{structure.last_zs_range[0]:.2f}, {structure.last_zs_range[1]:.2f}]\")\n            lines.append(f\"  背驰: {'⚠️ 是' if structure.divergence else '否'}\")\n            if structure.buy_sell_points:\n                for bsp in structure.buy_sell_points:\n                    lines.append(f\"  🔔 买卖点: {bsp}\")\n            lines.append(\"\")\n\n        # 风控检查\n        open_trades = self.store.get_open_trades(symbol=symbol)\n        if open_trades:\n            quote = self.perception.get_quote(symbol, market)\n            if quote:\n                current_price = quote.get('price', 0) or quote.get('last_price', 0)\n                for t in open_trades:\n                    zs_range = structures.get('日线', structures.get(list(structures.keys())[0]))\n                    zs = zs_range.last_zs_range if zs_range else None\n                    alerts = self.risk_engine.check_all(t, current_price, zs)\n\n[203 more lines in file. Use offset=229 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286526351}}
{"type":"message","id":"c67695a1","parentId":"bcb0a52f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:33.084Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ChanlunAgent already has a complete command set. The issue is that it needs Feishu App credentials to work. Let me check if those are configured.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0e8f5b10a7c84e5297859f27","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":80,"offset":229,"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":934,"output":123,"cacheRead":117312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118369,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286526357}}
{"type":"message","id":"22b1f75c","parentId":"c67695a1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:33.090Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0e8f5b10a7c84e5297859f27","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    if alerts:\n                        lines.append(\"⚠️ 风控告警:\")\n                        for a in alerts:\n                            lines.append(f\"  [{a.level}] {a.message}\")\n                        lines.append(\"\")\n\n        return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\n    def _cmd_signals(self, args: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"查看信号\"\"\"\n        signals = self.store.get_signals(limit=10)\n        if not signals:\n            return \"📡 暂无信号记录\"\n\n        lines = [\"📡 最近信号:\\n\"]\n        for s in signals:\n            emoji = {\"divergence_top\": \"🔴\", \"divergence_bottom\": \"🟢\", \"zs_range\": \"🟡\"}.get(s['signal_type'], \"⚡\")\n            lines.append(\n                f\"{emoji} {s['symbol']} ({s['freq']}) | {s['signal_type']} | \"\n                f\"${s['price']:.2f} | {s['created_at'][:16]}\"\n            )\n        return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\n    def _cmd_close(self, args: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"平仓\"\"\"\n        symbol = args.strip() or self.config.symbol.symbol\n        trades = self.store.get_open_trades(symbol=symbol)\n\n        if not trades:\n            return f\"❌ {symbol} 无未平仓交易\"\n\n        results = []\n        for t in trades:\n            # 获取当前价格\n            quote = self.perception.fetcher.get_quote(symbol, self.config.symbol.market) if self.perception.fetcher else None\n            current_price = quote.price if quote else t['entry_price']\n\n            pnl = (current_price - t['entry_price']) * t['quantity']\n            pnl_pct = (current_price / t['entry_price'] - 1) * 100\n\n            self.store.update_trade(\n                t['trade_id'],\n                exit_price=current_price,\n                pnl=pnl,\n                pnl_pct=pnl_pct,\n                exit_time=datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                status=\"closed\"\n            )\n\n            emoji = \"✅\" if pnl > 0 else \"❌\"\n            results.append(\n                f\"{emoji} {t['symbol']} 平仓 | 盈亏: ${pnl:.2f} ({pnl_pct:+.2f}%)\"\n            )\n\n            # 自动反思\n            if self.config.auto_reflect:\n                self._generate_trade_reflection(t, current_price, pnl, pnl_pct)\n\n        return \"\\n\".join(results)\n\n    def _cmd_reflect(self, args: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"生成反思（含优化建议）\"\"\"\n        trades = self.store.get_trades(status='closed', limit=5)\n        if not trades:\n            return \"📝 暂无已平仓交易，无法生成反思\"\n\n        # 生成最近交易反思\n        latest = trades[0]\n        trade_reflection = self.reflection_engine.generate_post_trade_reflection(latest)\n\n        # 获取优化建议\n        suggestions = self.reflection_engine.get_optimization_suggestions()\n\n        lines = [trade_reflection, \"\\n📊 参数优化建议:\\n\"]\n        for category, data in suggestions.items():\n            if category == \"总体建议\":\n                lines.append(f\"\\n💡 总体建议:\")\n                for tip in data:\n                    lines.append(f\"  • {tip}\")\n            elif isinstance(data, dict) and data:\n\n[123 more lines in file. Use offset=309 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286533088}}
{"type":"message","id":"320137e3","parentId":"22b1f75c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:53.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The ChanlunAgent already has all the commands implemented. The Feishu full-loop interaction is essentially already built. The remaining piece is connecting it to OpenClaw's existing Feishu integration so that @mentions in Fe groups trigger ChanlunAgent commands.\n\nThis is more of a configuration/integration task rather than a coding task. The ChanlunAgent commands work as standalone, but to work through Feishu @Bot, it needs to be registered as an OpenClaw skill that processes Feishu @mentions.\n\nLet me check if there's already a skill definition for this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ChanlunAgent 已有完整指令集（持仓/分析/信号/平仓/反思/日报/状态/帮助）。飞书全闭环需要配置飞书 App 凭证（app_id/app_secret）来连接 Bot。当前缺少这个配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ccb73fa7e36245eb8a62804f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"app_id\\|app_secret\\|FEISHU_APP\" /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":858,"output":352,"cacheRead":118208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119418,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286533092}}
{"type":"message","id":"cec97b7b","parentId":"320137e3","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:15:53.493Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ccb73fa7e36245eb8a62804f","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/settings.yaml:  app_id: \"\"\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/settings.yaml:  app_secret: \"\"\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/agent_config.json:    \"app_id\": \"cli_a94b9b34aafadbb6\",\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/agent_config.json:    \"app_secret\": \"hf39q4FVKqst4lR7NPSLMfJLlEOUkM0S\","}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5,"aggregated":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/settings.yaml:  app_id: \"\"\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/settings.yaml:  app_secret: \"\"\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/agent_config.json:    \"app_id\": \"cli_a94b9b34aafadbb6\",\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/agent_config.json:    \"app_secret\": \"hf39q4FVKqst4lR7NPSLMfJLlEOUkM0S\",","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779286553491}}
{"type":"message","id":"d5bb7dda","parentId":"cec97b7b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:16:11.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The config already has app_id and app_secret filled in! The ChanlunAgent should be able to connect to Feishu. But the question is whether this is the right approach — connecting ChanlunAgent directly to Feishu, or routing through OpenClaw.\n\nSince we already have OpenClaw connected to Feishu, it would be better to use OpenClaw as the router and have ChanlunAgent as a skill/module that OpenClaw calls. This avoids duplicate connections.\n\nThe current setup has OpenClaw connected to Feishu → messages come to OpenClaw → OpenClaw can invoke ChanlunAgent commands.\n\nThe \"飞书全闭环\" means: VAN can @Bot in Feishu to trigger ChanlunAgent commands like \"持仓\", \"分析\", etc. This should already work through OpenClaw if we register ChanlunAgent as a callable skill.\n\nLet me check if there's already an OpenClaw skill for ChanlunAgent.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"飞书凭证已配置。现在验证 ChanlunAgent 能否通过 OpenClaw Skill 运行："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f8997445cb944442801dc2c6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/skills/chanlun-agent/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"No skill directory\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":3968,"output":485,"cacheRead":115456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119909,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779286553496}}
