{"type":"message","id":"1973005e","parentId":"5f82dee2","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:16:33.085Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the ChanlunAgent already has all the commands implemented. The Feishu full-loop integration is about having it respond to Feishu messages. Since we're using OpenClaw as the gateway, the ChanlunAgent can be accessed through the OpenClaw skill system. Let me think about how to integrate it.\n\nThe simplest way is to make ChanlunAgent available as a module that I (the OpenClaw agent) can call. Since I already have access to all the files, I can import and use ChanlunAgent directly. The \"飞书全闭环\" is already partially working — VAN can ask me to do analysis and I use the chanlun-agent code to do it.\n\nWhat's missing is:\n1. A proper OpenClaw skill that wraps ChanlunAgent commands\n2. Automated signal scanning (cron-based)\n\nBut since the user asked me to continue the roadmap in order, and we're at \"飞书全闭环交互\", let me check what exactly needs to be done.\n\nActually, looking at the progress report again:\n- 飞书全闭环交互 (P2) - @Agent 持仓/分析/信号/平仓/反思/日报\n-","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1779286571610,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted"}}
