ions_send 直连\n\n**飞书 Agent @ Agent 配置：**\n- 文档位置：https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/GtniwsJOzirrBEkmDFGcswmMnQg\n- 需开启权限：`im:message.group_at_msg.include_bot:readonly`\n- OpenClaw 默认已开启，Hermes 需手动配置：`hermes config set feishu.allow_bots mentions`\n\n**ChanlunAgent MVP 路线图（Captain分享）：**\n- 30天落地计划：基础设施→信号质量→风控→自进化闭环\n- RGB知识库架构：R-规则库/G-指南库/B-最佳实践库\n- 飞书全闭环：@Agent 持仓/分析/信号/平仓/反思/日报\n- 文件位置...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (exec): /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/:\ntotal 12\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 May 20 15:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 May 20 15:10 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1082 May 20 15:10 reflection_template.md\n\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/:\ntotal 12\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 May 20 15:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 May 20 15:10 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1291 May 20 15:10 signal_sop.md\n\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/:\ntotal 16\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 May 20 15:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root 4096 May 20 15:...\n- Assistant: 找到了。以下是 30 天方案和当前进度对齐：\n\n---\n\n**ChanlunAgent MVP 30天落地计划**\n\n**阶段一：基础设施（Day 1-7）**\n| 项目 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|\n| SQLite TokenStore | ✅ 完成 | store.py |\n| 配置中心 | ✅ 完成 | config.py |\n| ChanlunAgent 核心 | ✅ 完成 | 8个指令可用 |\n| RGB 知识库初始 | ✅ 完成 | R-rules/G-guides/B-practices |\n| iTick bug 修复 | ✅ 完成 | Enum 问题 |\n| Smart Data Router | ✅ 完成 | 智能路由4源 |\n| czsc 集成 | ✅ 完成 | v0.10.12 + CzscExtension |\n| 飞书 App 凭证配置 | ⏳ 待做 | |\n| OpenClaw RAG 配置 | ⏳ 待做 | |\n\n**阶段二：信号质量（Day 8-14）**\n| 项目 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 类二买识别 | ✅ 完成 | CzscExtension.detect_like_second_buy |\n| 中枢震荡买卖点 | ✅ 完成 | detect_shock...\n\n<read-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-20.md\n<