{"type":"message","id":"07fc0262","parentId":"b6142bd8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T18:51:06.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create a SKILL.md for the chanlun-agent skill that can be triggered by @mentions in Feishu. The skill should handle commands like 持仓, 分析, 信号, 平仓, 反思, 日报, 状态, 帮助.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f038617f74cf4cbfbe55dfcf","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# ChanlunAgent - 缠论交易助手\n\n飞书 @Bot 交互的缠论交易系统。支持持仓查询、缠论分析、信号监控、自动反思。\n\n## 指令列表\n\n| 指令 | 功能 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `持仓` | 查询当前持仓 | `持仓` |\n| `分析 [品种]` | 缠论多级别分析 | `分析 CRCL` |\n| `信号` | 查看最近信号 | `信号` |\n| `平仓 [品种]` | 平仓操作 | `平仓 CRCL` |\n| `反思` | 生成最近交易反思 | `反思` |\n| `日报` | 生成每日交易报告 | `日报` |\n| `状态` | 系统状态检查 | `状态` |\n| `帮助` | 显示帮助 | `帮助` |\n\n## 使用方式\n\n在飞书中 @Bot 并发送指令即可：\n- `@Bot 分析 CRCL` — 获取 CRCL 缠论分析\n- `@Bot 持仓` — 查看当前持仓\n- `@Bot 信号` — 查看最近交易信号\n\n## 系统架构\n\n```\n用户 @Bot → OpenClaw → ChanlunAgent Skill → czsc 分析 → 风控检查 → 信号生成\n                                                    ↓\n                                            反思引擎 → RGB知识库更新\n```\n\n## 依赖\n\n- czsc v0.10.12\n- Tiger Broker SDK\n- Finnhub API\n- OpenClaw 飞书集成\n\n## 文件位置\n\n- 主程序: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py`\n- czsc 扩展层: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/czsc_extension.py`\n- 风控引擎: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py`\n- 反思引擎: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py`\n- RGB更新: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/rgb_updater.py`\n- 回测引擎: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/backtest_engine.py`\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/chanlun-agent/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":208,"output":637,"cacheRead":68032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68877,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason"