{"type":"message","id":"d5c9c4a9","parentId":"998728d6","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:23:38.676Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It works! The system:\n1. Successfully got realtime quote from Finnhub: $112.25\n2. Analyzed 3 timeframes: daily (16笔 3中枢), 30min (16笔 1中枢), 5min (15笔 2中枢)\n3. Detected resonance: single level daily up\n4. Generated signal: LONG CRCL @ $112.27 x 445 shares\n5. Set stop loss: $108.90\n\nLet me commit this and provide the summary to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 实时交易模拟系统启动成功！**\n\n```\n品种: CRCL\n当前价: $112.25\n分析结果:\n  日线: 16笔 3中枢 (方向: up)\n  30分钟: 16笔 1中枢\n  5分钟: 15笔 2中枢\n\n信号: 🔔 单级别共振: 日线up\n执行: 🟢 LONG CRCL @ $112.27 x 445\n止损: $108.90\n```"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_97baa3b46a3848f592b95be7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && git add -A && git commit -m \"实时交易模拟系统 (LivePaperTrader)\n\n- 多周期分析: daily/30min/5min\n- 智能确定交易方向: auto/long/short\n- 多级别共振检查: 1级/2级/3级共振\n- 做多/做空支持\n- 移动止损 + 止损保护\n- 连亏熔断机制\n- 自动反思 + RGB知识库更新\n- 首次测试: CRCL LONG @ $112.27 x 445\" 2>&1 | tail -3"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1078,"output":535,"cacheRead":113856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115469,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779305007830}}
