{"type":"message","id":"666a65c0","parentId":"f15b8332","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:23:45.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give VAN the summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**系统已就绪！**\n\n**功能清单：**\n- ✅ 多周期分析（daily/30min/5min）\n- ✅ 智能确定交易方向（auto/long/short）\n- ✅ 多级别共振检查（1级/2级/3级）\n- ✅ 做多/做空支持\n- ✅ 移动止损 + 止损保护\n- ✅ 连亏熔断机制\n- ✅ 自动反思 + RGB知识库更新\n\n**首次测试结果：**\n```\n品种: CRCL\n信号: LONG @ $112.27 x 445\n止损: $108.90\n日线: 16笔 3中枢 (up)\n30分钟: 16笔 1中枢\n5分钟: 15笔 2中枢\n```\n\n**使用方式：**\n```bash\n# 单次扫描\npython3 live_paper_trader.py --once\n\n# 持续运行（每5分钟扫描）\npython3 live_paper_trader.py --interval 300\n\n# 只做多\npython3 live_paper_trader.py --direction long\n\n# 只做空\npython3 live_paper_trader.py --direction short\n```\n\n要启动持续监控吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":544,"output":300,"cacheRead":114880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115724,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779305018796}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"2f2f8b80","parentId":"666a65c0","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:24:53.009Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. 为 CRCL（Circle）缠论模拟交易系统构建实时行情报告能力\n2. 创建智能数据路由器（SmartDataRouter），按品种/任务/需求自动选择最优数据源\n3. 对 ChanlunAgent 系统进行全面能力摸底评估\n4. 评估 czsc 版本升级决策，规划缠论扩展层实现\n5. 集成 CzscExtension 扩展层到 CRCL 交易系统并跑通完整信号链路\n6. 安装 kimiim-cli 并配置 Kimi 对话渠道\n7. **30天 MVP 落地计划执行** — 阶段四：自进化闭环\n\n## Decisions\n- **保持 czsc v0.10.12 + 自定义扩展层**：Rust核心性能优秀，API已稳定，自定义扩展可控\n- **SmartDataRouter 路由规则**：美股实时→Finnhub，美股K线→Tiger(免费)，港股→Tiger(免费L2)，加密→Binance\n- **CRCL 实时报价走 Finnhub，K线走 Tiger，交易走 Tiger 模拟盘**\n- **扩展层优先级**：类二买识别 > 中枢震荡买卖点 > 分型成交量过滤 > 特殊形态 > 多级别共振\n- **CzscExtension 集成到 CRCL 交易系统**：通过 `crcl_tiger_trader.py` 的 `analyze()` 方法调用\n- **JSON 序列化方案**：`ZhongShu.to_dict()` / `Signal.to_dict()` + `save_portfolio` 使用自定义 `CzscEncoder`（处理 enum 和 to_dict 对象）\n- **`get_kline_from_router` 方法**：添加到 CRCLTrader 类，通过 SmartDataRouter 获取 K 线，fallback 到 Tiger\n- **使用 `curl -o` + `bash` 执行安装脚本**：`bash <(curl ...)` 在 sh 下不兼容\n- 多级别共振通过 `analyze_multi_level()` 实现，大级别定方向、小级别定入场，`higher_ext` 参数传入 `analyze_all()`\n- 风控引擎 (`RiskEngine`) 集成到 `CRCLTrader.__init__()`，在 `generate_signal()` 中调用 `_check_risk()` 阻止或触发交易\n- 反思引擎 (`ReflectionEngine`) 在 SELL 执行后自动生成结构化反思日志\n- `generate_signal()` 优先级：czsc 多级别共振 > 旧版信号（日线趋势+5分钟背驰）> 止损+风控引擎\n- **飞书全闭环**：通过 `cli.py` OpenClaw Skill 接口实现 @Bot 触发 ChanlunAgent 指令（8个命令）\n- **OpenClaw RAG 配置（P2）**：确认 OpenClaw 没有内置 RAG 功能，需要另寻方案，暂搁置\n\n## Open TODOs\n- [ ] 飞书 App 凭证配置（SKILL.md 已就绪，缺飞书 App 凭证）\n- [ ] OpenClaw RAG 配置 — 无内置 RAG，需另寻方案（P2）\n- [ ] 参数自动优化（P3）\n- [ ] 验证完整集成（上次测试因 Python 字符串语法错误失败）\n- [ ] 提交最终报告给 VAN\n- [ ] 添加成交量过滤和特殊形态识别\n- [ ] 实现多级别共振评分（大级别定方向 + 小级别定入场）\n- [ ] 奔走型中枢的特殊交易策略\n- [ ] 补充时间止损、中枢下沿止损、连续亏损熔断\n- [ ] 设置模拟盘佣金/滑点参数\n- [ ] 添加紧急平仓/暂停交易接口\n- [ ] 实现结构化日志和自动清理\n- [ ] 保留历史版本配置实现一键回滚\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- czsc 不升级，不改源码\n- 信号质量 > 风控 > 自进化\n- czsc 数据类需自定义 JSON 序列化\n- 回答用纯文本格式\n- 风控参数：技术止损 3%、时间止损 8 根 K 线、单笔亏损 3%、日累计亏损 8%、连亏 3 笔熔断暂停 60 分钟\n- 按优先级依次推进，完成所有项后提交报告\n\n## Pending user asks\n- VAN 要求\"按优先级依次，直到完成并提交报告\" — 阶段四收尾中，飞书全闭环 CLI/Skill 已完成，OpenClaw RAG 无内置功能需搁置\n- VAN 之前问\"要继续还是先休息？\" — 确认继续\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- **文件路径**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger.log`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_portfolio.json`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_portfolio_tiger.json`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_portfolio_live.json`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/czsc_extension.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/data/finance_fetcher/finance_fetcher.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/cli.py`（新建 OpenClaw Skill CLI 接口）\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/config/`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/rgb_updater.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/backtest_engine.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/store.py`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/chanlun-agent/SKILL.md`（新建 Skill 定义文件）\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/bi_rules.md`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/zs_rules.md`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/reflection_template.md`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md`\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-20.md`