{"type":"message","id":"0282e91c","parentId":"86f7390a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:30:18.929Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fd4f25388a0c21434168501df1\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fd4e6ad88a4b2e11ceca906e62\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 03:30 GMT+8\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fd4f25388a0c21434168501df1]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n交易级别，理由？持续监控。"}],"timestamp":1779305418926}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a5b21d7","parentId":"0282e91c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:30:26.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to:\n1. Determine the trading level (timeframe) for these stocks\n2. Provide reasoning\n3. Set up continuous monitoring\n\nLet me analyze each stock using chanlun analysis to determine the optimal trading level.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，分析各品种的缠论交易级别。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7218e0ca1a54419b8e56b14f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'data')\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom czsc import CZSC, RawBar, Freq\nfrom czsc_extension import CzscExtension\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\nsymbols = ['NVDA', 'TSLA', 'MSTR', 'AVGO', 'AMD']\n\nfor symbol in symbols:\n    print(f\"\\n{'='*50}\")\n    print(f\"📊 {symbol} 缠论分析\")\n    print(f\"{'='*50}\")\n    \n    for tf in ['daily', '30min', '5min']:\n        try:\n            if tf == 'daily':\n                df = client.get_daily_bars(symbol, limit=200)\n                freq = Freq.D\n            else:\n                df = client.get_intraday_bars(symbol, period=tf, limit=200)\n                freq = Freq.F5\n            \n            if df is None or df.empty:\n                print(f\"  {tf}: 无数据\")\n                continue\n            \n            bars = []\n            for _, row in df.iterrows():\n                ts = row.get('time', 0)\n                dt = datetime.fromtimestamp(ts / 1000) if isinstance(ts, (int, float)) and ts > 1e12 else datetime.now()\n                bars.append(RawBar(symbol=symbol, dt=dt, freq=freq,\n                    open=float(row['open']), high=float(row['high']),\n                    low=float(row['low']), close=float(row['close']),\n                    vol=float(row.get('vol', row.get('volume', 0))),\n                    amount=float(row.get('amount', 0))))\n            \n            if len(bars) < 50:\n                print(f\"  {tf}: 数据不足 ({len(bars)}根)\")\n                continue\n            \n            ka = CZSC(bars)\n            ext = CzscExtension(ka, symbol=symbol, timeframe=tf)\n            analysis = ext.analyze_all()\n            \n            bi_count = len(ext.bi_list)\n            zs_count = len(ext.zs_list)\n            direction = ext.zs_list[-1].direction if ext.zs_list else 'unknown'\n            signals = analysis.get('signals', [])\n            valid_signals = [s for s in signals if not s.get('filtered')]\n            \n            print(f\"  {tf}: {bi_count}笔 {zs_count}中枢 | 方向: {direction} | 信号: {len(valid_signals)}个\")\n            \n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"  {tf}: 分析失败 - {str(e)[:50]}\")\n\nPYEOF","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1351,"output":721,"cacheRead":79296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81368,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779305418928}}
