{"type":"message","id":"2f9fe184","parentId":"74dd06bf","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:32:18.900Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about trading levels (timeframes) for each stock, reasons, and setting up continuous monitoring. Let me analyze the results and provide recommendations.\n\nFrom the analysis:\n- NVDA: daily 23笔 1中枢 (up), 30min 15笔 4中枢 (up), 5min 15笔 3中枢 (down)\n- TSLA: daily 21笔 3中枢 (up), 30min 15笔 3中枢 (down), 5min 23笔 4中枢 (up)\n- MSTR: daily 16笔 4中枢 (up), 30min 19笔 3中枢 (neutral), 5min 17笔 2中枢 (down)\n- AVGO: daily 19笔 3中枢 (up), 30min 13笔 2中枢 (up), 5min 16笔 3中枢 (neutral)\n- AMD: daily 18笔 3中枢 (up), 30min 9笔 1中枢 (neutral), 5min 18笔 4中枢 (neutral)\n\nNow I need to determine the optimal trading level for each:\n1. For high volatility stocks like NVDA, TSLA, MSTR - 30min is good for swing trading, 5min for day trading\n2. For stocks with clear daily trends - use daily for direction, 30min for entry\n\nLet me provide the analysis and set up monitoring.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**📊 缠论交易级别分析**\n\n| 品种 | 日线 | 30分钟 | 5分钟 | **建议交易级别** | **理由** |\n|------|------|--------|-------|------------------|----------|\n| **NVDA** | 23笔 1中枢 ↑ | 15笔 4中枢 ↑ | 15笔 3中枢 ↓ | **30分钟** | 日线趋势清晰，30分钟中枢多(4个)波动大，适合波段 |\n| **TSLA** | 21笔 3中枢 ↑ | 15笔 3中枢 ↓ | 23笔 4中枢 ↑ | **5分钟** | 5分钟笔多(23笔)中枢多，波动剧烈，适合日内 |\n| **MSTR** | 16笔 4中枢 ↑ | 19笔 3中枢 → | 17笔 2中枢 ↓ | **30分钟** | 30分钟中枢震荡，日线趋势向上，适合30分钟波段 |\n| **AVGO** | 19笔 3中枢 ↑ | 13笔 2中枢 ↑ | 16笔 3中枢 → | **日线** | 日线/30分钟同向，趋势稳定，适合日线持仓 |\n| **AMD** | 18笔 3中枢 ↑ | 9笔 1中枢 → | 18笔 4中枢 → | **观望** | 30分钟/5分钟震荡，等待方向明确 |\n\n---\n\n**🎯 详细分析：**\n\n**NVDA — 30分钟波段交易**\n- 日线: 23笔 1中枢向上，趋势明确\n- 30分钟: 4个中枢，震荡剧烈，波动空间大\n- 5分钟: 3中枢向下，与日线背离\n- **策略**: 日线定方向(多)，30分钟找入场点\n\n**TSLA — 5分钟日内交易**\n- 日线: 3中枢向上\n- 30分钟: 3中枢向下，震荡\n- 5分钟: 23笔4中枢，极高波动\n- **策略**: 5分钟级别操作，快进快出\n\n**MSTR — 30分钟波段**\n- 日线: 4中枢向上，结构完整\n- 30分钟: 3中枢中性，等待方向选择\n- **策略**: 30分钟突破跟进\n\n**AVGO — 日线趋势持仓**\n- 日线/30分钟同向向上，趋势稳定\n- **策略**: 日线级别持仓，跟随趋势\n\n---\n\n现在启动持续监控？"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:63","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom live_paper_trader import LivePaperTrader\n\n# 配置监控列表\nsymbols_config = {\n    'NVDA': {'direction': 'auto', 'interval': 300},\n    'TSLA': {'direction': 'auto', 'interval': 300},\n    'MSTR': {'direction': 'auto', 'interval': 300},\n}\n\nprint(\"🚀 启动多品种实时监控系统\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nfor symbol, cfg in symbols_config.items():\n    print(f\"  {symbol}: 方向={cfg['direction']}, 扫描间隔={cfg['interval']}秒\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"\\n⚠️  注意: 当前为模拟交易模式\")\nprint(\"📱 监控报告将保存到 reports/live_sim/\")\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":59474,"output":1066,"cacheRead":9984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779305511103}}
{"type":"message","id":"41694515","parentId":"2f9fe184","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:32:19.450Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:63","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🚀 启动多品种实时监控系统\n============================================================\n  NVDA: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n  TSLA: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n  MSTR: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n============================================================\n\n⚠️  注意: 当前为模拟交易模式\n📱 监控报告将保存到 reports/live_sim/"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":544,"aggregated":"🚀 启动多品种实时监控系统\n============================================================\n  NVDA: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n  TSLA: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n  MSTR: 方向=auto, 扫描间隔=300秒\n============================================================\n\n⚠️  注意: 当前为模拟交易模式\n📱 监控报告将保存到 reports/live_sim/","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779305539447}}
{"type":"message","id":"a9d1e6ec","parentId":"41694515","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:32:23.558Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should now provide a summary and offer to start the monitoring. Let me create a monitoring script that can track multiple symbols.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**持续监控方案：**\n\n需要我启动实时监控吗？\n\n**选项：**\n1. **单品种监控** — 选择 NVDA/TSLA/MSTR 其中一个\n2. **多品种轮询** — 依次扫描多个品种\n3. **后台持续运行** — 每5分钟自动扫描\n\n**监控内容：**\n- 实时价格\n- 多周期缠论分析\n- 共振信号检测\n- 自动模拟交易执行\n- 风控检查\n- 报告生成\n\n请选择监控方式？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":1252,"output":139,"cacheRead":69376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70767,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779305539451}}
