{"type":"message","id":"5eda5e50","parentId":"a05d278d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:51:54.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that the monitoring must use Tiger's simulation account for real order placement, not just paper trading simulation. Let me check the current implementation and update it to use the actual Tiger simulation account API.\n\nThe current `live_paper_trader.py` is doing paper trading only (simulated within the code). VAN wants it to actually place orders through Tiger's API to the simulation account.\n\nI need to:\n1. Stop the current monitor\n2. Create a new version that uses TigerClient's actual order methods\n3. Connect to Tiger's simulation account (paper trading account) to place real orders","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，停止当前模拟，改用 **Tiger 模拟账户真实下单**。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:72","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 停止当前监控\nkill $(cat /tmp/soxs_monitor.pid) 2>/dev/null || true\necho \"已停止当前监控\"\n\n# 检查 Tiger 模拟账户状态\ncd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🐯 Tiger 模拟账户状态\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\n\n# 账户信息\naccount = client.get_account_info()\nprint(f\"账户ID: {account.get('account_id')}\")\nprint(f\"账户类型: {account.get('account_type')}\")\nprint(f\"初始资金: ${account.get('initial_capital', 0):,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"可用资金: ${account.get('available_funds', 0):,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"总权益: ${account.get('net_liquidation', 0):,.2f}\")\n\n# 当前持仓\npositions = client.get_positions()\nprint(f\"\\n当前持仓: {len(positions)} 个\")\nfor p in positions:\n    print(f\"  {p.get('symbol')}: {p.get('quantity')}股 @ ${p.get('average_cost', 0):.2f}\")\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":3373,"output":480,"cacheRead":84992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88845,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779306701355}}
