{"type":"message","id":"acfd830e","parentId":"5eb314be","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:55:32.386Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The order was placed successfully! Order ID is 4. Now let me provide a summary to VAN and commit the changes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**🎉 下单成功！**\n\n```\n✅ 订单提交成功: BUY 34843 SOXS @ MKT\n   订单ID: 4\n   品种: SOXS (3倍做空半导体ETF)\n   数量: 34,843股\n   价格: $8.61 (市价单)\n   预计金额: ~$300,000\n```\n\n---\n\n**📊 当前状态：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 账户资金 | $1,000,000 |\n| 已用资金 | ~$300,000 (30%) |\n| 剩余资金 | ~$700,000 |\n| 持仓 | SOXS 34,843股 |\n| 止损 | $8.27 (-4%) |\n\n---\n\n**🔧 已修复问题：**\n1. ✅ SDK v3.5.8 `create_order` 需要 `account` 参数\n2. ✅ `sec_type='STK'` 必须指定\n3. ✅ `time_in_force='DAY'` 必须大写\n4. ✅ `order_type` 使用字符串而非枚举\n\n---\n\n现在启动 **持续监控**？（每5分钟检查信号，自动下单/平仓）"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:90","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && git add -A && git commit -m \"Tiger Live Trader - 模拟账户真实下单\n\n- tiger_live_trader.py: 缠论信号 + Tiger模拟盘真实下单\n- 修复 SDK v3.5.8 订单参数 (account/sec_type/time_in_force)\n- SOXS 测试下单成功: 34,843股 @ $8.61\n- 订单ID: 4\n- 可用资金: $1,000,000 (使用30%约$300K)\" 2>&1 | tail -3"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":731,"output":424,"cacheRead":98816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99971,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779306922369}}
