{"type":"message","id":"1e123f38","parentId":"fb01f9e9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:07:41.901Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Close the current position (sell SOXS)\n2. Stop the monitoring\n3. Fix the code to properly check for chanlun buy signals\n\nLet me do this step by step.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，立即执行：平仓 → 停止监控 → 修复代码。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:93","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 1. 停止监控\necho \"1. 停止监控...\"\nkill $(cat /tmp/tiger_live.pid) 2>/dev/null\necho \"   ✅ 监控已停止\"\n\n# 2. 平仓 SOXS\necho \"\"\necho \"2. 平仓 SOXS...\"\ncd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\n# 检查持仓\npositions = client.get_positions()\nfor p in positions:\n    if p.get('symbol') == 'SOXS':\n        qty = p.get('quantity', 0)\n        print(f\"   持仓: {qty}股\")\n        if qty > 0:\n            # 下卖单\n            result = client.place_order('SOXS', 'SELL', qty)\n            if result:\n                print(f\"   ✅ 平仓订单已提交: 订单ID {result}\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"   ❌ 平仓失败\")\n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"   无持仓\")\n\n# 检查账户\naccount = client.get_account_info()\nprint(f\"   可用资金: ${account.get('available_funds', 0):,.2f}\")\nPYEOF\n\necho \"\"\necho \"3. 等待成交...\"\nsleep 3\n\n# 4. 确认状态\necho \"\"\necho \"4. 确认最终状态...\"\ncd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\npositions = client.get_positions()\nprint(f\"   当前持仓: {len(positions)} 个\")\nfor p in positions:\n    print(f\"     {p.get('symbol')}: {p.get('quantity')}股\")\nPYEOF\n\necho \"\"\necho \"✅ 平仓完成，监控已停止\"","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usag