{"type":"message","id":"03c2d512","parentId":"91ae874c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:08:35.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the code correctly says \"无缠论买点信号\" (no chanlun buy signal), which is correct. The system now properly checks for actual chanlun buy signals instead of just checking direction.\n\nLet me commit this fix and summarize for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 修复完成！**\n\n**现在系统行为：**\n```\n建议方向: long\n无缠论买点信号 ← 正确！没有一买/二买/背驰等信号\n```\n\n**修改内容：**\n1. 新增 `has_valid_buy_signal()` 方法\n2. 检查各级别是否有：一买/二买/类二买/背驰买\n3. 买点强度必须 ≥ 0.5 才开仓\n4. 无买点时显示\"无缠论买点信号\"\n\n**开仓条件（修复后）：**\n```\n必须同时满足：\n1. 日线方向明确 (long/short)\n2. 出现有效买点（一买/二买/类二买/背驰）\n3. 买点强度 ≥ 0.5\n4. 多级别共振（可选）\n```\n\n---\n\n**当前状态：**\n- 监控：已停止\n- 持仓：SOXS 34,843股（暂时无法平仓，时段限制）\n- 浮亏：约 -$2,000\n\n---\n\n**提交修复：**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:99","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && git add -A && git commit -m \"修复: Tiger Live Trader 缠论买点检查\n\n- 新增 has_valid_buy_signal() 方法\n- 要求出现一买/二买/类二买/背驰才开仓\n- 买点强度必须 >= 0.5\n- 无买点时显示'无缠论买点信号'\n- 避免仅凭方向共振就开仓的问题\" 2>&1 | tail -3"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":886,"output":388,"cacheRead":111616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112890,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779307707512}}
