{"type":"message","id":"37895643","parentId":"080c8395","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:15:38.698Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户分享了一张Tiger App的截图，显示：\n1. 当前持仓：34843股 SOXS\n2. 当前价格：约 $8.57 / $8.58\n3. 用户想要卖出，但当前是\"盘中+盘前盘后\"时段\n4. 交易时间显示：美东时间 4:00 am 至 8:00 pm\n\n当前北京时间 04:13，美东时间应该是 16:13（美东比北京慢12小时，夏令时）或 15:13（冬令时）。\n\n用户可能想说明：\n1. 当前在交易时段内（盘前盘后允许交易）\n2. 或者想确认是否可以在此时段平仓\n\n让我检查一下当前时间：\n- 北京时间：2026-05-21 04:13\n- 美东时间：2026-05-20 16:13（美东是5月20日下午4:13）\n\n美东时间 4:00 am 至 8:00 pm：\n- 4:00 am ET = 北京时间 16:00 (前一天)\n- 8:00 pm ET = 北京时间 08:00\n\n所以当前时间（北京时间 04:13）对应美东时间 16:13（前一天），在盘前盘后时段内（4:00 am - 8:00 pm ET）。\n\n但之前下单失败说\"当前时段不支持下单\"，可能是因为：\n1. SDK需要设置 `outside_rth=True`（我已经设置了）\n\n\n2. 可能需要选择\"盘中+盘前盘后\"选项\n3. 或者是模拟账户的限制\n\n我重新检查一下代码，可能需要调整订单参数来支持盘前盘后交易。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我看到截图了。**当前在盘前盘后时段**，Tiger App 显示可以交易（4:00 am - 8:00 pm ET）。\n\n但之前 API 下单失败，可能是因为需要**显式启用盘前盘后交易**。\n\n让我修复订单参数："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:30","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":20,"offset":290,"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":44925,"output":449,"cacheRead":9984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55358,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779308117535}}
{"type":"message","id":"8bd60208","parentId":"37895643","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:15:38.709Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:30","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    account=self.account,\n                    contract=contract,\n                    action=action,\n                    order_type='LMT',\n                    quantity=quantity,\n                    limit_price=price,\n                    time_in_force='DAY',\n                    outside_rth=True\n                )\n\n            result = self.trade_client.place_order(order)\n            if result:\n                order_id = order.order_id\n                logger.info(f\"✅ 订单提交成功: {action} {quantity} {symbol} @ {order_type} - OrderID: {order_id}\")\n                return str(order_id)\n            else:\n                logger.error(f\"❌ 订单提交失败\")\n                return None\n        except Exception as e:\n            logger.error(f\"❌ 下单异常: {e}\")\n\n[740 more lines in file. Use offset=310 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779308138707}}
{"type":"message","id":"3d4dec76","parentId":"8bd60208","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:15:51.460Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我看到代码中已经设置了 `outside_rth=True`，但仍然下单失败。\n\n可能是因为 SDK v3.5.8 的 `create_order` 方法不接受 `outside_rth` 参数，或者参数名不同。\n\n让我检查一下 SDK 文档或尝试使用 `Order` 对象直接设置。\n\n实际上，我看到截图中的\"盘中+盘前盘后\"选项被选中，这可能是需要在订单中设置的。\n\n让我尝试修改代码，使用 Order 对象并设置 outside_rth 属性。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"SDK 中 `outside_rth=True` 已设置，但可能需要不同的方式。让我尝试平仓："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:31","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.domain.contract import Contract\nfrom tigeropen.trade.domain.order import Order\nfrom tigeropen.common.const import OrderType\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🐯 尝试平仓 SOXS (盘前盘后)\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\n\n# 获取持仓\npositions = client.get_positions()\nfor p in positions:\n    if p.get('symbol') == 'SOXS':\n        qty = p.get('quantity', 0)\n        print(f\"持仓: {qty}股\")\n        \n        # 直接创建 Order 对象\n        contract = Contract(symbol='SOXS', sec_type='STK', currency='USD', exchange='SMART')\n        order = Order(\n            account=client.account,\n            contract=contract,\n            action='SELL',\n            order_type='MKT',\n            quantity=qty,\n            time_in_force='DAY'\n        )\n        # 设置盘前盘后\n        order.outside_rth = True\n        \n        print(f\"订单: SELL {qty} SOXS @ MKT (outside_rth=True)\")\n        \n        try:\n            result = client.trade_client.place_order(order)\n            if result:\n                print(f\"✅ 平仓订单提交成功: {order.order_id}\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"❌ 平仓失败\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"❌ 异常: {e}\")\n        \n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"无持仓\")\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":634,"output":549,"cacheRead":54904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56087,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779308138710}}
