{"type":"message","id":"bc9241ba","parentId":"426f98f9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:16:18.570Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"明白了！模拟账户不支持 GTC (撤销前有效)，只能用 DAY。\n\n但之前用 DAY 也失败了，说\"当前时段不支持下单\"。这可能是因为模拟账户在特定时段有限制。\n\n让我检查截图中的时间设置：\n- 截图显示\"盘中+盘前盘后\"选项\n- 交易时间：美东 4:00 am 至 8:00 pm\n\n现在北京时间 04:16 = 美东时间 16:16（前一天下午4:16），在允许的交易时段内。\n\n可能 SDK 的 `outside_rth` 参数在模拟账户上无效，或者需要在账户级别设置。\n\n让我尝试另一种方式 - 使用限价单而不是市价单，因为截图中显示的是限价单。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**问题找到了：模拟账户限制**\n\n- ❌ 不支持 `GTC` (撤销前有效)\n- ❌ 盘前盘后时段可能不支持市价单\n\n截图显示您用的是**限价单**，让我试试："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:33","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\nfrom tigeropen.trade.domain.contract import Contract\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🐯 尝试限价平仓 SOXS\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\n\n# 获取当前价格\nfrom smart_data_router import create_router\nrouter = create_router()\nquote = router.get_quote('SOXS')\ncurrent_price = quote.price if quote and hasattr(quote, 'price') else 8.56\nprint(f\"当前价格: ${current_price:.2f}\")\n\n# 获取持仓\npositions = client.get_positions()\nfor p in positions:\n    if p.get('symbol') == 'SOXS':\n        qty = p.get('quantity', 0)\n        print(f\"持仓: {qty}股\")\n        \n        # 限价单，价格略低于当前价确保成交\n        limit_price = round(current_price - 0.01, 2)\n        print(f\"限价: ${limit_price:.2f}\")\n        \n        contract = Contract(symbol='SOXS', sec_type='STK', currency='USD', exchange='SMART')\n        \n        try:\n            order = client.trade_client.create_order(\n                account=client.account,\n                contract=contract,\n                action='SELL',\n                order_type='LMT',\n                quantity=qty,\n                limit_price=limit_price,\n                time_in_force='DAY',\n                outside_rth=True\n            )\n            result = client.trade_client.place_order(order)\n            if result:\n                print(f\"✅ 限价平仓订单提交成功: {order.order_id}\")\n                print(f\"   限价: ${limit_price:.2f}\")\n            else:\n                print(f\"❌ 平仓失败\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"❌ 异常: {e}\")\n        \n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"无持仓\")\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":797,"output":703,"cacheRead":56064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57564,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779308163656}}
