{"type":"message","id":"2b9e5017","parentId":"33c03554","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:19:16.340Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to store durable memories to memory/2026-05-21.md before the session is compacted. I need to record the important events from this session:\n\n1. SOXS trading issue - the system opened a position without proper Chanlun buy signals\n2. The fix implemented - added proper Chanlun buy point checking (一买/二买/类二买/背驰)\n3. Changed from market orders to limit orders for pre/post market trading\n4. The loss from the incorrect trade: ~$1,443\n5. The importance of proper signal validation before trading\n\nLet me append this to the memory file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:40","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /workspace/projects/workspace/memory && cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-21.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 2026-05-21 04:17 - Tiger Live Trader 修复记录\n\n### 问题\nSOXS 交易开仓没有经过系统检验的缠论买点，仅凭\"日线+30分钟方向一致\"就开仓，违反交易纪律。\n\n### 后果\n- 错误开仓: SOXS 34,843股 @ $8.60\n- 平仓价格: $8.53\n- 亏损: ~$1,443 (-1.44%)\n\n### 修复内容\n1. **添加缠论买点检查** (`has_valid_buy_signal`):\n   - 要求出现一买/二买/类二买/背驰才开仓\n   - 买点强度必须 >= 0.5\n   - 无买点时显示\"无缠论买点信号\"\n\n2. **改用限价单**:\n   - 市价单不支持盘前盘后交易\n   - 限价单可24小时交易（4:00am-8:00pm ET）\n   - 买单: 当前价+0.01，卖单: 当前价-0.01\n\n### 教训\n- 不能仅凭多级别共振开仓\n- 必须等待明确的缠论买点信号\n- 交易纪律: 无买点 = 不开仓\n\n### 代码提交\n- `tiger_live_trader.py` - 修复缠论买点检查 + 限价单\n- Git commit: b062fc79\nEOF\necho \"记忆已写入 memory/2026-05-21.md\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":46388,"output":513,"cacheRead":14080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60981,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779308333676}}
