{"type":"message","id":"7e9004f5","parentId":"5bfcd389","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:24:22.524Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:49","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n# ============ 路由规则 ============\n\n# 每种资产类型的最优源排序\nROUTE_RULES: Dict[AssetType, Dict[TaskType, List[Provider]]] = {\n    AssetType.US_STOCK: {\n        TaskType.REALTIME_QUOTE: [Provider.FINNHUB, Provider.ITICK, Provider.POLYGON],\n        TaskType.KLINE:          [Provider.TIGER, Provider.POLYGON, Provider.FINNHUB],\n        TaskType.TRADE:          [Provider.TIGER],\n        TaskType.SNAPSHOT:       [Provider.FINNHUB, Provider.TIGER],\n    },\n    AssetType.HK_STOCK: {\n        TaskType.REALTIME_QUOTE: [Provider.TIGER, Provider.ITICK],\n        TaskType.KLINE:          [Provider.TIGER, Provider.ITICK],\n        TaskType.TRADE:          [Provider.TIGER],\n        TaskType.SNAPSHOT:       [Provider.TIGER],\n    },\n    AssetType.A_STOCK: {\n        TaskType.REALTIME_QUOTE: [Provider.TIGER, Provider.ITICK],\n        TaskType.KLINE:          [Provider.TIGER, Provider.ITICK],\n        TaskType.TRADE:          [Provider.TIGER],\n    },\n    AssetType.CRYPTO: {\n        TaskType.REALTIME_QUOTE: [Provider.BINANCE, Provider.FINNHUB],\n        TaskType.KLINE:          [Provider.BINANCE, Provider.FINNHUB],\n        TaskType.TRADE:          [Provider.BINANCE],\n    },\n    AssetType.FOREX: {\n        TaskType.REALTIME_QUOTE: [Provider.FINNHUB, Provider.ITICK],\n        TaskType.KLINE:          [Provider.FINNHUB, Provider.ITICK],\n    },\n}\n\n\n# ============ 源适配器 ============\n\nclass TigerAdapter:\n    \"\"\"Tiger API 适配器\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, secrets: Dict):\n        self._client = None\n        self._trade_client = None\n        self._secrets = secrets\n\n    def _ensure_client(self):\n        if self._client is not None:\n            return\n        try:\n            from tigeropen.quote.quote_client import QuoteClient\n            from tigeropen.trade.trade_client import TradeClient\n\n[642 more lines in file. Use offset=180 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779308662522}}
{"type":"message","id":"c5b6c69b","parentId":"7e9004f5","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:24:42.638Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我明白了整个架构。让我为用户总结清楚：\n\n1. **交易记录来源**：Tiger 模拟账户（`21409378833585169`）- 这是真实的交易记录\n2. **实时行情来源**：Finnhub（美股实时行情首选 provider）\n3. **K线数据来源**：Tiger（美股历史K线首选 provider）\n4. **交易执行**：Tiger 模拟账户（唯一支持交易的 provider）\n\n让我向用户清楚地报告这些细节。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**查清楚了，分两部分：**\n\n---\n\n## 📊 交易记录来源\n\n| 项目 | 来源 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **交易执行** | ✅ **Tiger 模拟账户** | 账户ID: `21409378833585169` |\n| **订单记录** | ✅ **Tiger 模拟盘** | 订单ID 4 (买入) / 订单ID 7 (卖出) |\n| **持仓数据** | ✅ **Tiger 模拟盘** | 真实返回的持仓/资金数据 |\n\n**这是真实的 Tiger 模拟账户交易记录**，不是本地模拟。\n\n---\n\n## 📈 行情数据来源（不同！）\n\n| 数据类型 | Provider | 优先级 | 说明 |\n|----------|----------|--------|------|\n| **实时报价** | **Finnhub** | 第一优先 | 美股实时行情 |\n| **K线数据** | **Tiger** | 第一优先 | 历史K线 |\n| **备用** | iTick | 降级 | Finnhub失败时用 |\n\n**实际日志证据：**\n```\n✅ SOXS via finnhub: $8.54 (1071ms)   ← 实时价格来自 Finnhub\n✅ 订单提交成功: BUY 34843 SOXS @ MKT - OrderID: 4   ← 交易在Tiger\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 架构图解\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 Smart Data Router                   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  实时报价: Finnhub → iTick (备用)                   │\n│  K线数据: Tiger → Polygon → Finnhub                │\n│  交易下单: Tiger (唯一)                            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n         │                       │\n         ▼                       ▼\n   ┌──────────────┐      ┌──────────────┐\n   │   Finnhub    │      │    Tiger     │\n   │  (行情数据)  │      │ (交易+K线)   │\n   │  API Key x5  │      │ 模拟账户     │\n   └──────────────┘      └──────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 关键发现\n\n| 问题 | 真相 |\n|------|------|\n| 行情和交易是同一个 provider 吗？ | **不是** - 行情用 Finnhub，交易用 Tiger |\n| Tiger 美股实时行情免费吗？ | **否** - 需要购买权限 |\n| 为什么用 Finnhub 行情？ | Tiger 美股权限未购买，只能用 Finnhub |\n| 交易是真实的吗？ | **是** - Tiger 模拟账户真实下单 |\n\n---\n\n**结论：**\n- ✅ **交易记录**：Tiger 模拟账户真实记录\n- ✅ **实时价格**：Finnhub 提供（非 Tiger）\n- ✅ **K线数据**：Tiger 提供\n- ❌ **Tiger 美股实时行情**：未购买权限\n\n这是**混合架构**：Finnhub 给价格，Tiger 执行交易。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":549,"output":740,"cacheRead":74496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75785,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779308662525}}
