{"type":"message","id":"54bc120a","parentId":"983808f6","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:39:13.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是用户问的是否为完整的交易记录。让我检查一下Tiger API返回的完整订单信息，对比一下我之前返回的信息是否完整。\n\n从代码来看，get_orders()返回的是：\n- order_id\n- symbol\n- action\n- quantity\n- filled\n- status\n- order_type\n- limit_price\n\n但我之前返回的信息可能不完整。让我验证一下实际的订单记录包含哪些字段，然后给出完整的答案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:50","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🐯 Tiger APP 完整交易记录查询\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\n\norders = client.get_orders()\nfor o in orders:\n    print(f\"\\n订单ID: {o.get('order_id')}\")\n    print(f\"  品种: {o.get('symbol')}\")\n    print(f\"  方向: {o.get('action')}\")\n    print(f\"  数量: {o.get('quantity')}\")\n    print(f\"  已成交: {o.get('filled')}\")\n    print(f\"  状态: {o.get('status')}\")\n    print(f\"  订单类型: {o.get('order_type')}\")\n    print(f\"  限价: ${o.get('limit_price', 0):.2f}\" if o.get('limit_price') else \"  限价: 无\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"与APP对比检查...\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":57600,"output":397,"cacheRead":20992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78989,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779309531402}}
