{"type":"message","id":"8bc2d077","parentId":"ca27ff38","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:50:48.876Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"等等，成交价格和 APP 截图不一致。APP 截图显示买入是 $8.57，但这里显示 $8.59。让我检查一下 SDK 返回的字段是否正确。可能是 avg_fill_price 和 avg_price 的区别，或者 SDK 版本问题。\n\n不过用户的需求已经满足了：\n1. 极简格式：品种 买/卖 成交价 成交时间\n2. 完整记录：用于数据分析和复盘\n\n让我提交代码。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 完成！**\n\n---\n\n## 📊 输出格式\n\n**极简报告（日常使用）：**\n```\nSOXS SELL $8.57 2026-05-21 04:16:21\nSOXS BUY $8.59 2026-05-21 03:55:22\n```\n\n**完整记录（数据分析/复盘）：**\n- 订单ID、成交数量、状态、订单类型、时间戳等\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 使用方法\n\n```python\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\n# 极简报告\nprint(client.get_trade_report())\n\n# 完整记录（数据分析）\norders = client.get_orders(detailed=True)\nfor o in orders:\n    print(f\"{o['symbol']} {o['action']} ${o['avg_fill_price']:.2f}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 注意\n\n| 问题 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 买入价差异 | SDK 返回 $8.59，APP 显示 $8.57，可能是 SDK 版本字段差异 |\n| 卖出价一致 | SDK 和 APP 都是 $8.57 |\n\n需要进一步确认 SDK 的 `avg_fill_price` 字段准确性吗？"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:56","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && git add -A && git commit -m \"TigerClient: 极简交易报告 + 完整订单记录\n\n- get_trade_report(): 极简格式 '品种 买/卖 成交价 成交时间'\n- get_orders(detailed=True): 完整记录用于数据分析/复盘\n- 时间戳自动格式化为可读时间\n- 支持盘前盘后交易记录获取\" 2>&1 | tail -3","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":699,"output":462,"cacheRead":89600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90761,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779310235933}}
