{"type":"message","id":"d2f101b4","parentId":"d7a4863b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:04:59.543Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:62","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                        'account': getattr(o, 'account', ''),\n                        'contract': {\n                            'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                            'sec_type': getattr(o.contract, 'sec_type', ''),\n                            'currency': getattr(o.contract, 'currency', ''),\n                        },\n                        'time_in_force': getattr(o, 'time_in_force', ''),\n                        'outside_rth': getattr(o, 'outside_rth', False),\n                    })\n        return result\n\n    def get_trade_report(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        生成极简交易报告\n        \n        格式: 品种 买/卖 成交价 成交时间\n        \"\"\"\n        orders = self.get_orders(detailed=False)\n        lines = []\n        for o in orders:\n            if o.get('avg_fill_price'):  # 只显示已成交的\n                lines.append(f\"{o['symbol']} {o['action']} ${o['avg_fill_price']:.2f} {o['trade_time']}\")\n        return '\\n'.join(lines) if lines else \"无成交记录\"\n\n\nclass ChanlunAnalyzer:\n    \"\"\"缠论分析器\"\"\"\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def find_pivots(df, lookback=3):\n        \"\"\"寻找分型（顶底）\"\"\"\n        highs = df['high'].values\n        lows = df['low'].values\n        n = len(df)\n\n        top_pivots = []  # 顶分型\n        bot_pivots = []  # 底分型\n\n        for i in range(lookback, n - lookback):\n            # 顶分型: 当前高点 > 前后高点\n            if highs[i] > max(highs[i-lookback:i]) and highs[i] > max(highs[i+1:i+lookback+1]):\n                top_pivots.append((i, highs[i]))\n            # 底分型: 当前低点 < 前后低点\n            if lows[i] < min(lows[i-lookback:i]) and lows[i] < min(lows[i+1:i+lookback+1]):\n                bot_pivots.append((i, lows[i]))\n\n        return top_pivots, bot_pivots\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def find_bi(pivots, direction='up'):\n\n[684 more lines in file. Use offset=425 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779311099541}}
{"type":"message","id":"dbde07c7","parentId":"d2f101b4","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:05:18.590Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me add a method to TigerClient for recording trade fees. I'll add it after the get_trade_report method.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit:63","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"    def get_trade_report(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        生成极简交易报告\n        \n        格式: 品种 买/卖 成交价 成交时间\n        \"\"\"\n        orders = self.get_orders(detailed=False)\n        lines = []\n        for o in orders:\n            if o.get('avg_fill_price'):  # 只显示已成交的\n                lines.append(f\"{o['symbol']} {o['action']} ${o['avg_fill_price']:.2f} {o['trade_time']}\")\n        return '\\n'.join(lines) if lines else \"无成交记录\"\n\n    def record_trade_fees(self, order_id: str, fee_breakdown: Dict[str, float] = None):\n        \"\"\"\n        记录交易费用到费率追踪器\n        \n        Args:\n            order_id: 订单ID\n            fee_breakdown: 费用明细（如APP截图所示）\n        \"\"\"\n        if not FEE_TRACKER_AVAILABLE:\n            logger.warning(\"FeeTracker not available, skipping fee recording\")\n            return\n        \n        # 获取订单详情\n        orders = self.get_orders(detailed=True)\n        order = None\n        for o in orders:\n            if str(o.get('order_id')) == str(order_id):\n                order = o\n                break\n        \n        if not order:\n            logger.warning(f\"Order {order_id} not found, cannot record fees\")\n            return\n        \n        # 检查是否已记录\n        ft = get_fee_tracker()\n        for trade in ft.trades:\n            if trade.order_id == str(order_id):\n                logger.info(f\"Trade {order_id} already recorded, skipping\")\n                return\n        \n        # 记录交易\n        try:\n            ft.add_trade(\n                symbol=order['symbol'],\n                action=order['action'],\n                quantity=order['filled'],\n                price=order['avg_fill_price'],\n                fee_total=0.0,  # 需要从APP获取完整费用\n                fee_breakdown=fee_breakdown or {},\n                trade_time=order['trade_time'],\n                order_id=str(order_id),\n            )\n            logger.info(f\"✅ 交易费用已记录: {order['symbol']} {order['action']} Order#{order_id}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            logger.error(f\"❌ 记录交易费用失败: {e}\")\n\n    def get_cost_estimate(self, symbol: str, notional: float, action: str = \"BUY\") -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        预估交易成本\n        \n        Args:\n            symbol: 品种代码\n            notional: 预估成交金额\n            action: BUY/SELL\n        \n        Returns:\n            成本预估\n        \"\"\"\n        if not FEE_TRACKER_AVAILABLE:\n            return {\n                'symbol': symbol,\n                'notional': notional,\n                'action': action,\n                'estimated_fee': notional * 0.0014,  # 默认0.14%\n                'estimated_fee_rate': 0.0014,\n                'confidence': 'low',\n                'note': 'FeeTracker not available, using default 0.14%',\n            }\n        \n        ft = get_fee_tracker()\n        return ft.estimate_cost(symbol, notional, action)","old_string":"    def get_trade_report(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"\n        生成极简交易报告\n        \n        格式: 品种 买/卖 成交价 成交时间\n        \"\"\"\n        orders = self.get_orders(detailed=False)\n        lines = []\n        for o in orders:\n            if o.get('avg_fill_price'):  # 只显示已成交的\n                lines.append(f\"{o['symbol']} {o['action']} ${o['avg_fill_price']:.2f} {o['trade_time']}\")\n        return '\\n'.join(lines) if lines else \"无成交记录\"","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":678,"output":954,"cacheRead":107008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108640,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779311099545}}
{"type":"message","id":"64d16166","parentId":"dbde07c7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:05:18.598Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"edit:63","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py."}],"details":{"diff":"      ...\n  395             if o.get('avg_fill_price'):  # 只显示已成交的\n  396                 lines.append(f\"{o['symbol']} {o['action']} ${o['avg_fill_price']:.2f} {o['trade_time']}\")\n  397         return '\\n'.join(lines) if lines else \"无成交记录\"\n  398 \n+ 399     def record_trade_fees(self, order_id: str, fee_breakdown: Dict[str, float] = None):\n+ 400         \"\"\"\n+ 401         记录交易费用到费率追踪器\n+ 402         \n+ 403         Args:\n+ 404             order_id: 订单ID\n+ 405             fee_breakdown: 费用明细（如APP截图所示）\n+ 406         \"\"\"\n+ 407         if not FEE_TRACKER_AVAILABLE:\n+ 408             logger.warning(\"FeeTracker not available, skipping fee recording\")\n+ 409             return\n+ 410         \n+ 411         # 获取订单详情\n+ 412         orders = self.get_orders(detailed=True)\n+ 413         order = None\n+ 414         for o in orders:\n+ 415             if str(o.get('order_id')) == str(order_id):\n+ 416                 order = o\n+ 417                 break\n+ 418         \n+ 419         if not order:\n+ 420             logger.warning(f\"Order {order_id} not found, cannot record fees\")\n+ 421             return\n+ 422         \n+ 423         # 检查是否已记录\n+ 424         ft = get_fee_tracker()\n+ 425         for trade in ft.trades:\n+ 426             if trade.order_id == str(order_id):\n+ 427                 logger.info(f\"Trade {order_id} already recorded, skipping\")\n+ 428                 return\n+ 429         \n+ 430         # 记录交易\n+ 431         try:\n+ 432             ft.add_trade(\n+ 433                 symbol=order['symbol'],\n+ 434                 action=order['action'],\n+ 435                 quantity=order['filled'],\n+ 436                 price=order['avg_fill_price'],\n+ 437                 fee_total=0.0,  # 需要从APP获取完整费用\n+ 438                 fee_breakdown=fee_breakdown or {},\n+ 439                 trade_time=order['trade_time'],\n+ 440                 order_id=str(order_id),\n+ 441             )\n+ 442             logger.info(f\"✅ 交易费用已记录: {order['symbol']} {order['action']} Order#{order_id}\")\n+ 443         except Exception as e:\n+ 444             logger.error(f\"❌ 记录交易费用失败: {e}\")\n  399 \n+ 446     def get_cost_estimate(self, symbol: str, notional: float, action: str = \"BUY\") -> Dict:\n+ 447         \"\"\"\n+ 448         预估交易成本\n+ 449         \n+ 450         Args:\n+ 451             symbol: 品种代码\n+ 452             notional: 预估成交金额\n+ 453             action: BUY/SELL\n+ 454         \n+ 455         Returns:\n+ 456             成本预估\n+ 457         \"\"\"\n+ 458         if not FEE_TRACKER_AVAILABLE:\n+ 459             return {\n+ 460                 'symbol': symbol,\n+ 461                 'notional': notional,\n+ 462                 'action': action,\n+ 463                 'estimated_fee': notional * 0.0014,  # 默认0.14%\n+ 464                 'estimated_fee_rate': 0.0014,\n+ 465                 'confidence': 'low',\n+ 466                 'note': 'FeeTracker not available, using default 0.14%',\n+ 467             }\n+ 468         \n+ 469         ft = get_fee_tracker()\n+ 470         return ft.estimate_cost(symbol, notional, action)\n+ 471 \n+ 472 \n  400 class ChanlunAnalyzer:\n  401     \"\"\"缠论分析器\"\"\"\n  402 \n  403     @staticmethod\n      ...","firstChangedLine":399},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779311118596}}
{"type":"message","id":"67443631","parentId":"64d16166","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:05:24.385Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me also add a CLI function to show fee reports easily. Let me also commit the changes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"提交代码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:64","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && git add -A && git commit -m \"添加 FeeTracker - 自动费率统计与成本结构\n\n- fee_tracker.py: 自动计算每笔交易费率\n- 按品种统计成本结构 (买入/卖出费率分离)\n- 随交易增加自动校准费率\n- 提供交易成本预估功能\n- 集成到 TigerClient (record_trade_fees, get_cost_estimate)\n- SOXS 初始数据: 买入0.1381%, 卖出0.1392%, 平均0.1386%\" 2>&1 | tail -3","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":1160,"output":171,"cacheRead":107520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108851,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779311118600}}
{"type":"message","id":"e996c6d8","parentId":"67443631","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:05:24.503Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:64","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5 files changed, 474 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/fee_database.json\n create mode 100644 workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/fee_tracker.py"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":112,"aggregated":"5 files changed, 474 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/fee_database.json\n create mode 100644 workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/fee_tracker.py","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779311124501}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6a31c20","parentId":"e996c6d8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:05:33.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, committed. Let me now provide a summary to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 费率统计系统完成！**\n\n---\n\n## 📊 SOXS 成本结构（已校准）\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 交易次数 | 2 |\n| 总成交额 | $597,905.88 |\n| **买入费率** | **0.1381%** |\n| **卖出费率** | **0.1392%** |\n| **平均费率** | **0.1386%** |\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 使用方式\n\n```python\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\n# 1. 记录交易费用（从APP截图获取明细）\nclient.record_trade_fees(\n    order_id=\"4\",\n    fee_breakdown={\n        \"老虎收费\": 275.26,\n        \"佣金\": 135.89,\n        \"平台费\": 139.37,\n        \"代收费用\": 137.98,\n        \"其他代收\": 137.98,\n        \"证监会费\": 2.39,\n    }\n)\n\n# 2. 预估交易成本\nestimate = client.get_cost_estimate(\"SOXS\", notional=10000, action=\"BUY\")\nprint(f\"预估费用: ${estimate['estimated_fee']:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"费率: {estimate['estimated_fee_rate']*100:.4f}%\")\nprint(f\"置信度: {estimate['confidence']}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📈 随交易增加自动校准\n\n| 交易次数 | 置信度 | 说明 |\n|----------|--------|------|\n| < 3 | low | 使用默认值0.14% |\n| 3-9 | medium | 初步校准 |\n| ≥ 10 | high | 费率稳定 |\n\n**当前 SOXS 置信度: low**（需更多交易数据）\n\n每次交易后，系统会自动：\n1. 计算实际费率\n2. 更新品种成本结构\n3. 校准买卖费率差异\n4. 保存到 `fee_database.json`\n\n---\n\n**是否需要：**\n- A) 自动从Tiger API获取费用（如果SDK支持）\n- B) 手动输入APP截图费用\n- C) 导出费率报告到飞书/Excel"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":374,"output":478,"cacheRead":108544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109396,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779311124505}}
