{"type":"message","id":"a6b83c01","parentId":"b68d36bd","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:10:09.741Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想知道 Tiger API 是否能自动获取费用明细，而不是手动输入。让我检查一下 Tiger SDK 是否支持获取费用数据。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"检查 Tiger API 是否能获取费用明细："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:65","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🔍 检查 Tiger API 费用字段\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\n\n# 获取订单并检查所有可用字段\norders = client.trade_client.get_orders()\nif orders:\n    o = orders[0]  # 检查第一个订单\n    print(f\"\\n订单ID: {o.order_id}\")\n    print(f\"\\n订单对象所有属性:\")\n    for attr in dir(o):\n        if not attr.startswith('_'):\n            try:\n                val = getattr(o, attr)\n                if not callable(val):\n                    print(f\"  {attr}: {val}\")\n            except:\n                pass\n    \n    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\n    print(\"🔍 检查是否有费用相关字段:\")\n    print(\"=\" * 60)\n    fee_fields = ['commission', 'fee', 'cost', 'charge', 'clearing', 'execution']\n    for field in fee_fields:\n        if hasattr(o, field):\n            print(f\"  ✅ {field}: {getattr(o, field)}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"  ❌ {field}: 不存在\")\nelse:\n    print(\"无订单数据\")\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\nprint(\"🔍 检查 contract 对象:\")\nprint(\"=\" * 60)\nif orders:\n    c = orders[0].contract\n    for attr in dir(c):\n        if not attr.startswith('_'):\n            try:\n                val = getattr(c, attr)\n                if not callable(val):\n                    print(f\"  contract.{attr}: {val}\")\n            except:\n                pass\n\nprint(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 60)\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":7545,"output":508,"cacheRead":102656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110709,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779311392423}}
