{"type":"message","id":"71426e92","parentId":"ce43b5df","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:10:45.786Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！发现 `commission` 字段就是费用！还有 `realized_pnl` 是已实现盈亏。\n\n从输出看：\n- `commission: 415.63` - 这就是卖出订单的总费用！\n- `realized_pnl: -1442.1068` - 已实现盈亏（和之前计算的 -$1,525 不完全一致，需要确认）\n\n让我更新代码，自动从 API 获取这些字段。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 发现费用字段！**\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 API 可用字段\n\n| 字段 | 值 | 说明 |\n|------|-----|------|\n| `commission` | **415.63** | ✅ **总费用** |\n| `realized_pnl` | **-1442.1068** | ✅ **已实现盈亏** |\n| `filled_cash_amount` | 298594.0571 | 成交总金额 |\n| `avg_fill_price` | 8.5697 | 成交均价（更精确） |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 自动获取费用数据"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit:66","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"    def get_orders(self, detailed=False) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        获取今日订单\n        \n        Args:\n            detailed: 是否返回完整详细信息（用于数据分析/复盘）\n        \n        Returns:\n            订单列表\n        \"\"\"\n        from datetime import datetime\n        \n        orders = self.trade_client.get_orders()\n        result = []\n        if orders:\n            for o in orders:\n                # 解析时间戳\n                trade_time = getattr(o, 'trade_time', getattr(o, 'update_time', ''))\n                if isinstance(trade_time, (int, float)) and trade_time > 1e12:\n                    trade_time_str = datetime.fromtimestamp(trade_time / 1000).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\n                else:\n                    trade_time_str = str(trade_time) if trade_time else ''\n                \n                # 获取费用数据\n                commission = getattr(o, 'commission', 0) or 0\n                realized_pnl = getattr(o, 'realized_pnl', 0) or 0\n                filled_cash = getattr(o, 'filled_cash_amount', 0) or 0\n                avg_fill = getattr(o, 'avg_fill_price', 0) or 0\n                \n                # 极简格式（默认）\n                if not detailed:\n                    result.append({\n                        'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                        'action': o.action,\n                        'avg_fill_price': avg_fill,\n                        'trade_time': trade_time_str,\n                        'commission': commission,\n                        'realized_pnl': realized_pnl,\n                    })\n                else:\n                    # 完整格式（用于复盘分析）\n                    result.append({\n                        'order_id': o.order_id,\n                        'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                        'action': o.action,\n                        'quantity': o.quantity,\n                        'filled': o.filled,\n                        'avg_fill_price': avg_fill,\n                        'filled_cash_amount': filled_cash,\n                        'commission': commission,\n                        'realized_pnl': realized_pnl,\n                        'status': str(o.status),\n                        'order_type': o.order_type,\n                        'limit_price': o.limit_price,\n                        'trade_time': trade_time_str,\n                        'create_time': getattr(o, 'create_time', ''),\n                        'account': getattr(o, 'account', ''),\n                        'contract': {\n                            'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                            'sec_type': getattr(o.contract, 'sec_type', ''),\n                            'currency': getattr(o.contract, 'currency', ''),\n                        },\n                        'time_in_force': getattr(o, 'time_in_force', ''),\n                        'outside_rth': getattr(o, 'outside_rth', False),\n                        'trading_session_type': getattr(o, 'trading_session_type', ''),\n                    })\n        return result","old_string":"    def get_orders(self, detailed=False) -> List[Dict]:\n        \"\"\"\n        获取今日订单\n        \n        Args:\n            detailed: 是否返回完整详细信息（用于数据分析/复盘）\n        \n        Returns:\n            订单列表\n        \"\"\"\n        from datetime import datetime\n        \n        orders = self.trade_client.get_orders()\n        result = []\n        if orders:\n            for o in orders:\n                # 解析时间戳\n                trade_time = getattr(o, 'trade_time', getattr(o, 'update_time', ''))\n                if isinstance(trade_time, (int, float)) and trade_time > 1e12:\n                    trade_time_str = datetime.fromtimestamp(trade_time / 1000).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\n                else:\n                    trade_time_str = str(trade_time) if trade_time else ''\n                \n                # 极简格式（默认）\n                if not detailed:\n                    result.append({\n                        'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                        'action': o.action,\n                        'avg_fill_price': getattr(o, 'avg_fill_price', 0) or getattr(o, 'avg_price', 0),\n                        'trade_time': trade_time_str,\n                    })\n                else:\n                    # 完整格式（用于复盘分析）\n                    result.append({\n                        'order_id': o.order_id,\n                        'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                        'action': o.action,\n                        'quantity': o.quantity,\n                        'filled': o.filled,\n                        'avg_fill_price': getattr(o, 'avg_fill_price', 0) or getattr(o, 'avg_price', 0),\n                        'status': str(o.status),\n                        'order_type': o.order_type,\n                        'limit_price': o.limit_price,\n                        'trade_time': trade_time_str,\n                        'create_time': getattr(o, 'create_time', ''),\n                        'account': getattr(o, 'account', ''),\n                        'contract': {\n                            'symbol': o.contract.symbol,\n                            'sec_type': getattr(o.contract, 'sec_type', ''),\n                            'currency': getattr(o.contract, 'currency', ''),\n                        },\n                        'time_in_force': getattr(o, 'time_in_force', ''),\n                        'outside_rth': getattr(o, 'outside_rth', False),\n                    })\n        return result","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_tiger_trader.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":1637,"output":1455,"cacheRead":110080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113172,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779311410985}}
