{"type":"message","id":"d9142024","parentId":"cf1b13a8","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:11:38.684Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完成了！现在费用可以自动从 API 获取，无需手动输入。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 完成！费用自动从 API 获取**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 使用方式（已简化）\n\n```python\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\nclient = TigerClient()\n\n# 自动记录费用（无需手动输入）\nclient.record_trade_fees(\"4\")  # 自动获取 commission/realized_pnl\nclient.record_trade_fees(\"7\")\n\n# 获取完整订单（含费用）\norders = client.get_orders(detailed=True)\nfor o in orders:\n    print(f\"费用: ${o['commission']:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"盈亏: ${o['realized_pnl']:.2f}\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📈 当前 SOXS 成本结构（API数据）\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 买入均价 | $8.5873 |\n| 卖出均价 | $8.5697 |\n| 价差 | -$0.0176 |\n| 买入费用 | $413.24 (0.1381%) |\n| 卖出费用 | $415.63 (0.1392%) |\n| **总盈亏** | **-$1,442.11** |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 优势\n\n| 之前 | 现在 |\n|------|------|\n| 手动输入APP截图费用 | **API自动获取** |\n| 无法获取盈亏数据 | **realized_pnl直接返回** |\n| 价格精度2位小数 | **4位小数更精确** |\n| 需要人工核对 | **自动记录校准** |\n\n**完全自动化，无需手动输入！**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":770,"output":348,"cacheRead":114944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116062,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779311490978}}
