{"type":"message","id":"4818361f","parentId":"21467c13","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:24:54.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完成了。用户想要的是一个简单的常量参考表，而不是复杂的自动追踪系统。现在的版本满足需求：\n1. 常量费率，基于Tiger标准\n2. 覆盖美股、港股、期货、ETF、期权\n3. 随时可以查询\n4. 提供性价比参考\n5. 不过度投入资源","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 完成！简化为常量费率参考表**\n\n---\n\n## 📋 文件结构\n\n```\nchanlun-agent/paper-trading/\n├── cost_reference.py     # 简化的常量费率参考\n├── fee_tracker.py        # 复杂的自动追踪（可选）\n└── fee_database.json     # 历史数据\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 推荐用法\n\n```python\nfrom cost_reference import estimate_cost\n\n# 快速查询任意品类成本\ncost = estimate_cost(\"US_STOCK\", 本金, \"BOTH\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 实盘准备参考\n\n| 品类 | 预估费率 | 本金$10万成本 |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| 港股 | ~0.16% (含印花税) | ~$160 |\n| 美股 | ~0.14-0.16% | ~$140-160 |\n| 美股ETF | ~0.14-0.16% | ~$140-160 |\n| 期货 | $3-6/手 | 按合约 |\n\n**无需实时监控，交易前估算即可。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":932,"output":293,"cacheRead":54528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55753,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779312287719}}
