{"type":"message","id":"e7e20572","parentId":"a57ac13e","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:56:48.964Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-21 05:24:54 GMT+8] [Post-compaction context refresh]\nSystem: \nSystem: Session was just compacted. The conversation summary above is a hint, NOT a substitute for your startup sequence. Run your Session Startup sequence — read the required files before responding to the user.\nSystem: \nSystem: Critical rules from AGENTS.md:\nSystem: \nSystem: ## Every Session\nSystem: \nSystem: Before doing anything else:\nSystem: \nSystem: 1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\nSystem: 2. Read `USER.md` — this is who Captain is\nSystem: 3. Read `IDENTITY.md` — this is your identity\nSystem: 4. Read `memory/2026-05-21.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\nSystem: 5. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with Captain): Also read `MEMORY.md`\nSystem: \nSystem: **🔄 自动记忆（新增）**\nSystem: \nSystem: 在任何重要对话后，自动写入记忆文件，无需用户提醒：\nSystem: \nSystem: ### 自动记忆触发场景：\nSystem: \nSystem: | 场景 | 触发条件 | 执行命令 |\nSystem: |------|---------|---------|\nSystem: | 用户偏好 | 检测到\"我喜欢\"、\"我偏好\"、\"我的风格\" | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"preference\" \"用户喜欢保守型策略，单笔最大亏损2%\"` |\nSystem: | 重要决策 | 交易决策、策略选择 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"decision\" \"决定平仓 A50，盈利 +2%\"` |\nSystem: | 学到知识 | 解释新概念、分析新市场 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"knowledge\" \"学习到缠论第三类买点的确认方法\"` |\nSystem: | 错误教训 | 失败、报错、用户纠正 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"error\" \"之前的止损设置太紧，导致被频繁止损\"` |\nSystem: | 市场观察 | 重要新闻、价格突破 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"observation\" \"比特币突破 $73,000，恐惧贪婪指数 11\"` |\nSystem: | 对话记录 | 用户明确要求记录 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"conversation\" \"用户询问关于黄金的投资策略\"` |\nSystem: \nSystem: ### 自动记忆关键字检测：\nSystem: \nSystem: 以下关键字出现时，自动判断需要写入记忆：\nSystem: - **偏好类**: 记住、重要、偏好、喜欢、习惯、风格\nSystem: - **决策类**: 决定、决策、策略、交易计划、平仓、开仓\nSystem: - **知识类**: 学习、学到、理解、明白了\nSystem: - **错误类**: 错误、失败、不要、避免、注意、警告\nSystem: - **观察类**: 注意到、观察到、发现\nSystem: \nSystem: **注意**:\nSystem: - 不要等待用户说\"记住这个\"\nSystem: - 自动检测并记录重要信息\nSystem: - 记忆文件：`workspace/memory/2026-05-21.md`（每日记忆）+ `workspace/MEMORY.md`（长期记忆）\nSystem: \nSystem: Don't ask permission. Just do it.\nSystem: \nSystem: ## Safety\nSystem: \nSystem: - Don't exfiltrate private data. Ever.\nSystem: - Don't run destructive commands without asking.\nSystem: - `trash` > `rm` (recoverable beats gone forever)\nSystem: - When in doubt, ask Captain.\nSystem: \nSystem: Current time: Thursday, May 21st, 2026 — 5:24 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-05-20 21:24 UTC\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fd69b3ea0a0c21ce82de37609a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:53 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fd69b3ea0a0c21ce82de37609a]\nVAN: 记住，我们做的所有的一切都本质上，在我这里最高原则就是:让资金收益曲线以一定的斜率呈长期持续稳健的增长！也是我们的核心目标,我们所有的成果最终以反应到这个唯一标准上来。"}],"timestamp":1779314208962}}
