{"type":"message","id":"756e88a6","parentId":"45667833","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:57:23.958Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-21 05:24:54 GMT+8] [Post-compaction context refresh]\nSystem: \nSystem: Session was just compacted. The conversation summary above is a hint, NOT a substitute for your startup sequence. Run your Session Startup sequence — read the required files before responding to the user.\nSystem: \nSystem: Critical rules from AGENTS.md:\nSystem: \nSystem: ## Every Session\nSystem: \nSystem: Before doing anything else:\nSystem: \nSystem: 1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\nSystem: 2. Read `USER.md` — this is who Captain is\nSystem: 3. Read `IDENTITY.md` — this is your identity\nSystem: 4. Read `memory/2026-05-21.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\nSystem: 5. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with Captain): Also read `MEMORY.md`\nSystem: \nSystem: **🔄 自动记忆（新增）**\nSystem: \nSystem: 在任何重要对话后，自动写入记忆文件，无需用户提醒：\nSystem: \nSystem: ### 自动记忆触发场景：\nSystem: \nSystem: | 场景 | 触发条件 | 执行命令 |\nSystem: |------|---------|---------|\nSystem: | 用户偏好 | 检测到\"我喜欢\"、\"我偏好\"、\"我的风格\" | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"preference\" \"用户喜欢保守型策略，单笔最大亏损2%\"` |\nSystem: | 重要决策 | 交易决策、策略选择 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"decision\" \"决定平仓 A50，盈利 +2%\"` |\nSystem: | 学到知识 | 解释新概念、分析新市场 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"knowledge\" \"学习到缠论第三类买点的确认方法\"` |\nSystem: | 错误教训 | 失败、报错、用户纠正 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"error\" \"之前的止损设置太紧，导致被频繁止损\"` |\nSystem: | 市场观察 | 重要新闻、价格突破 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"observation\" \"比特币突破 $73,000，恐惧贪婪指数 11\"` |\nSystem: | 对话记录 | 用户明确要求记录 | `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-write.sh \"conversation\" \"用户询问关于黄金的投资策略\"` |\nSystem: \nSystem: ### 自动记忆关键字检测：\nSystem: \nSystem: 以下关键字出现时，自动判断需要写入记忆：\nSystem: - **偏好类**: 记住、重要、偏好、喜欢