{"type":"message","id":"d4259f4e","parentId":"e742f2af","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:01:44.180Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is repeating their core philosophy about trading. This is an important message that defines their fundamental principles. I should acknowledge this and confirm my understanding, as this is the foundation of how I should operate as their trading assistant.\n\nThe key points are:\n1. Ultimate goal: Compound growth of capital with increasing slope (acceleration)\n2. Everything serves this goal - can be modified/replaced if conflicts\n3. Chanlun (缠论) as the core foundation - the only complete system that accurately expresses market essence\n4. Chanlun is the optimal underlying framework, not rigid dogma\n5. All auxiliary tools/indicators/filters/strategies/risk controls are built around Chanlun\n6. Core foundation never replaced, only optimized\n\nI should confirm this understanding clearly and concisely.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 完全理解，已铭记于心**\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 核心铁律\n\n**唯一终极目标：**\n> 资金收益曲线以逐步放大的斜率（加速度）实现长期、持续、稳健的复利增长\n\n**决策准则：**\n```\nif 有助于复利增长 → 保留/采用\nelse → 修改/替换/废弃\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📐 缠论核心基座\n\n| 属性 | 定位 |\n|------|------|\n| **性质** | 最优底层工具与核心基座 |\n| **特点** | 全景式、无死角表达市场本质 |\n| **优势** | 穿透指标滞后、情绪随机、品种差异 |\n| **适配** | 所有品种、所有周期、所有行情 |\n| **原则** | **永不替换，仅优化迭代** |\n\n---\n\n## ⚖️ 优化边界\n\n```\n缠论结构（根本骨架，永不替换）\n        ↓\n辅助指标/过滤规则/风控模型（可叠加迭代）\n        ↓\n极端行情局部适配（仅当缠论局部失效时）\n        ↓\n服务复利增长目标\n```\n\n---\n\n**收到。一切以收益曲线长期稳健复利增长为最高准则，缠论为核心基座，其余均可灵活调整、优化、甚至废弃。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":3110,"output":428,"cacheRead":68608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72146,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779314495454}}
{"type":"message","id":"b78396e9","parentId":"d4259f4e","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:01:44.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 完全理解，已铭记于心**\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 核心铁律\n\n**唯一终极目标：**\n> 资金收益曲线以逐步放大的斜率（加速度）实现长期、持续、稳健的复利增长\n\n**决策准则：**\n```\nif 有助于复利增长 → 保留/采用\nelse → 修改/替换/废弃\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📐 缠论核心基座\n\n| 属性 | 定位 |\n|------|------|\n| **性质** | 最优底层工具与核心基座 |\n| **特点** | 全景式、无死角表达市场本质 |\n| **优势** | 穿透指标滞后、情绪随机、品种差异 |\n| **适配** | 所有品种、所有周期、所有行情 |\n| **原则** | **永不替换，仅优化迭代** |\n\n---\n\n## ⚖️ 优化边界\n\n```\n缠论结构（根本骨架，永不替换）\n        ↓\n辅助指标/过滤规则/风控模型（可叠加迭代）\n        ↓\n极端行情局部适配（仅当缠论局部失效时）\n        ↓\n服务复利增长目标\n```\n\n---\n\n**收到。一切以收益曲线长期稳健复利增长为最高准则，缠论为核心基座，其余均可灵活调整、优化、甚至废弃。**"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779314504911}}
