{"type":"message","id":"64a3a562","parentId":"f8ed2a62","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:34:19.637Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is giving me autonomy to make decisions and take actions under the highest principle (the compounding growth goal). They don't want me to ask for permission for every step, but rather to act independently with the goal of minimizing cost and rapidly getting on track.\n\nKey points:\n1. No need to ask for permission\n2. I have autonomy to research, decide, debug, delegate, and plan under the highest principle\n3. Low comprehensive cost\n4. Align with the goal and quickly get on track\n5. Can @ them or others if resources are needed\n\nI should acknowledge this autonomy and indicate that I will proceed with actions. I should also provide a brief summary of what I will do next to align with the goal.\n\nLet me provide a concise confirmation and outline my immediate action plan.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**收到，自主执行，以最低成本快速推进。**"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:23","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md << 'EOF'\n# 行动计划 - 快速跨入正阿尔法轨道\n\n## 目标\n资金收益曲线转正并建立正向加速度（健康阿尔法）\n\n## Phase 1: 立即执行（今日）\n\n### 1.1 市场扫描\n- [ ] 扫描 SOXS/CRCL 缠论买点信号\n- [ ] 检查多级别共振状态\n- [ ] 评估开仓时机\n\n### 1.2 系统验证\n- [ ] 验证买点检查逻辑正常工作\n- [ ] 确认限价单参数正确\n- [ ] 测试小仓位（1%风险）\n\n## Phase 2: 本周完成\n\n### 2.1 回测验证\n- [ ] 历史买点信号胜率统计\n- [ ] 不同thresholds参数对比\n- [ ] 优化止损位置\n\n### 2.2 成本控制\n- [ ] 减少交易频率（精选高胜率机会）\n- [ ] 评估港股低费率品种\n- [ ] 最小化费用损耗\n\n## Phase 3: 下周启动\n\n### 3.1 纪律执行\n- [ ] 无买点 = 不开仓（铁律）\n- [ ] 监控收益曲线斜率\n- [ ] 每周复盘信号质量\n\n### 3.2 逐步放大\n- [ ] 连续3笔盈利后增加仓位\n- [ ] 确认正阿尔法后放大到正常仓位\n\n## 关键指标\n\n| 指标 | 当前 | 目标 | 达成标准 |\n|------|------|------|----------|\n| 累计盈亏 | -0.14% | >0% | 转正 |\n| 胜率 | 0% | >50% | 正期望 |\n| 交易频率 | 高 | 低 | 精选机会 |\n| 费用占比 | 0.28% | <0.15% | 降本 |\n\n## 风险控制\n\n1. **单笔最大亏损**: 2%（严格执行）\n2. **日最大亏损**: 6%（熔断线）\n3. **连续亏损**: 3笔后暂停（已内置）\n\n---\n\n*计划启动时间: 2026-05-21*\n*目标达成期限: 2周内转正*\nEOF\ncat /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":2013,"output":733,"cacheRead":79616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82362,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779316446112}}
