{"type":"message","id":"d16539b2","parentId":"4898308c","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:15:12.422Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"看起来脚本认为市场休市。这可能是因为时间判断有问题。让我检查一下代码中的时间判断逻辑。现在北京时间是09:14，港股和A股都应该已经开盘了（09:30开盘）。\n\n问题在于时间判断：\n- 当前时间 09:14 是 914（小时*100 + 分钟）\n- 代码判断 930 <= time_val <= 1200 为港股早市\n- 但 914 < 930，所以被认为是休市\n\n这是正确的，因为09:14确实早于09:30开盘时间。但用户说现在是09:12，市场应该已经开盘了。可能有时差问题或者用户的时间是预估的。\n\n让我修改方案，或者直接手动启动扫描。让我检查当前实际的扫描功能。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**系统检测到 09:14 市场仍处于休市状态（09:30开盘）**\n\n让我修正时间判断并立即启动："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit:35","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/hk_a_monitor.py","new_string":"def get_market_status():\n    \"\"\"获取当前市场状态\"\"\"\n    now = datetime.now()\n    hour, minute = now.hour, now.minute\n    time_val = hour * 100 + minute\n    \n    # 港股时段 (北京时间)\n    if 900 <= time_val < 930:\n        return \"hk_pre\", \"港股开市前\"\n    elif 930 <= time_val <= 1200:\n        return \"hk_morning\", \"港股早市\"\n    elif 1200 < time_val < 1300:\n        return \"hk_noon\", \"港股午间休市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1600:\n        return \"hk_afternoon\", \"港股午市\"\n    # A股时段\n    elif 915 <= time_val < 930:\n        return \"a_pre\", \"A股集合竞价\"\n    elif 930 <= time_val <= 1130:\n        return \"a_morning\", \"A股早市\"\n    elif 1130 < time_val < 1300:\n        return \"a_noon\", \"A股午间休市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1500:\n        return \"a_afternoon\", \"A股午市\"\n    else:\n        return \"closed\", \"休市\"","old_string":"def get_market_status():\n    \"\"\"获取当前市场状态\"\"\"\n    now = datetime.now()\n    hour, minute = now.hour, now.minute\n    time_val = hour * 100 + minute\n    \n    # 港股时段 (北京时间)\n    if 930 <= time_val <= 1200:\n        return \"hk_morning\", \"港股早市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1600:\n        return \"hk_afternoon\", \"港股午市\"\n    # A股时段\n    elif 930 <= time_val <= 1130:\n        return \"a_morning\", \"A股早市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1500:\n        return \"a_afternoon\", \"A股午市\"\n    else:\n        return \"closed\", \"休市\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":357,"output":707,"cacheRead":92416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93480,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779326091455}}
