{"type":"message","id":"45543662","parentId":"2de58fff","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:24:30.612Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:39","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n港A实时模拟交易监控器\n\nUsage:\n    python3 hk_a_monitor.py --market hk --interval 5min\n    python3 hk_a_monitor.py --market a --interval 5min\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport time\nimport argparse\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).parent))\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).parent.parent))\n\nfrom crcl_tiger_trader import TigerClient\n\n# 监控品种\nHK_SYMBOLS = ['00700', '03690', '01810', '09999']  # 腾讯、美团、小米、网易\nA_SYMBOLS = ['510050', '510300', '159915']  # 上证50ETF、沪深300ETF、创业板ETF\n\n\ndef get_market_status():\n    \"\"\"获取当前市场状态\"\"\"\n    now = datetime.now()\n    hour, minute = now.hour, now.minute\n    time_val = hour * 100 + minute\n    \n    # 港股时段 (北京时间)\n    if 900 <= time_val < 930:\n        return \"hk_pre\", \"港股开市前\"\n    elif 930 <= time_val <= 1200:\n        return \"hk_morning\", \"港股早市\"\n    elif 1200 < time_val < 1300:\n        return \"hk_noon\", \"港股午间休市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1600:\n        return \"hk_afternoon\", \"港股午市\"\n    # A股时段\n    elif 915 <= time_val < 930:\n        return \"a_pre\", \"A股集合竞价\"\n    elif 930 <= time_val <= 1130:\n        return \"a_morning\", \"A股早市\"\n    elif 1130 < time_val < 1300:\n        return \"a_noon\", \"A股午间休市\"\n    elif 1300 <= time_val <= 1500:\n        return \"a_afternoon\", \"A股午市\"\n    else:\n\n[213 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779326670610}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd0ff91a","parentId":"45543662","timestamp":"2026-05-21T01:24:44.138Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"当前监控的A股品种是：\n- 510050 上证50ETF\n- 510300 沪深300ETF\n- 159915 创业板ETF\n\n这些都是ETF，在A股是T+1交易的，不是T+0。\n\nA股真正的T+0品种包括：\n1. 可转债\n2. 部分跨境ETF（如纳指ETF、恒生科技ETF等）\n3. 货币ETF\n4. 黄金ETF\n5. 债券ETF\n6. 商品ETF\n\n我需要更新A_SYMBOLS为真正的T+0品种，并添加注释说明。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n**确认！当前监控的A股品种需要调整：**\n\n| 当前监控 | 类型 | T+0? | 说明 |\n|---------|------|------|------|\n| 510050 | 上证50ETF | ❌ T+1 | 国内指数ETF |\n| 510300 | 沪深300ETF | ❌ T+1 | 国内指数ETF |\n| 159915 | 创业板ETF | ❌ T+1 | 国内指数ETF |\n\n---\n\n### 📋 A股真正的T+0品种\n\n| 类别 | 示例代码 | 说明 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **跨境ETF** | 513100(纳指)、513130(恒生科技) | 追踪海外指数 |\n| **可转债** | 128xxx/113xxx | 债券属性，T+0 |\n| **货币ETF** | 511880(银华日利)、511990(华宝添益) | 货币基金 |\n| **黄金ETF** | 518880(华安黄金) | 商品ETF |\n| **债券ETF** | 511010(国债ETF) | 债券指数 |\n\n---\n\n**请 Captain 确认：**\n\n1. **要监控哪些T+0品种？** （请提供代码）\n2. **跨境ETF** 如纳指ETF(513100)、恒生科技ETF(513130)？\n3. **可转债** 有特定关注标的吗？\n4. **还是暂时只监控港股** (腾讯/美团/小米/网易都是T+0)？\n\n我将根据您的选择更新监控配置！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":755,"output":481,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51924,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779326670613}}
