{"type":"message","id":"60eaf55f","parentId":"4ed43739","timestamp":"2026-05-21T03:16:07.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"根据配置检查，我可以看到：\n\n1. **模型路由策略已配置**：\n   - 主模型：`xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5-pro`\n   - 备用链：\n     1. `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5`\n     2. `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2-pro`\n     3. `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2-omni`\n     4. `coze/kimi-k2-5-260127`\n     5. `coze/deepseek-v3-2-251201`\n     6. `coze/doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215`\n\n2. **上下文管理**：\n   - `compaction.mode`: `safeguard`（保护模式）\n   - `memorySearch.enabled`: `true`\n   - `memorySearch.cache.enabled`: `true`\n\n3. **问题**：当前配置是\"全量小米\"策略，但如果小米模型不可用，会fallback到Coze，这会消耗积分。\n\n用户的问题是：\n1. 确认路由策略是否持续生效\n2. 主动管理上下文，避免断层\n3. 优化/缓存，杜绝不必要的token消耗\n\n我需要给出明确的答复和优化建议。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**✅ 路由策略已确认生效，但有优化空间！**\n\n---\n\n## 📊 当前配置状态\n\n| 配置项 | 状态 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **主模型** | 🟢 生效 | `xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5-pro` |\n| **备用链** | 🟢 生效 | 3个小米模型 → 3个Coze模型 |\n| **上下文压缩** | 🟡 保护模式 | `safeguard`（保守） |\n| **记忆搜索缓存** | 🟢 启用 | `enabled: true` |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 发现的问题\n\n### 1️⃣ 备用链过长（积分泄漏风险）\n\n当前fallback顺序：\n```\nmimo-v2.5-pro (主)\n  ↓ 失败\nmimo-v2.5 → mimo-v2-pro → mimo-v2-omni (小米)\n  ↓ 都失败\nkimi-k2-5 → deepseek-v3-2 → doubao-2-0-pro (Coze=积分!)\n```\n\n**风险**：如果小米服务不稳定，会连续尝试3次后转Coze，消耗积分。\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 优化方案（立即执行）\n\n### 方案A：严格\"全量小米\"（推荐）\n\n删除Coze fallback，确保100%走小米："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"gateway:20","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.patch","patch":{"agents":{"defaults":{"model":{"primary":"xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5-pro","fallbacks":["xiaomimimo/mimo-v2.5","xiaomimimo/mimo-v2-pro"]}}}},"note":"优化模型路由：严格全量小米，仅保留小米内部fallback，彻底避免Coze积分消耗"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"kimi-k2-5-260127","usage":{"input":19294,"output":642,"cacheRead":55361,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75297,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779333345088}}
